window.IELTS_TOPIC={"topic":17,"en":"Art, Artists & Creativity","zh":"藝術與創造力","items":[{"w":"painter","pos":"n.","def":"a person who paints pictures","cn":"畫家","s":"My aunt is a ________ who works in a small studio by the river, and she sells her pictures at the weekend market.","zh":"我阿姨是一位畫家,在河邊的小工作室工作,而且她週末會在市集賣她的畫。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A1","t":"畫家"},{"w":"canvas","pos":"n.","def":"strong cloth that artists paint on","cn":"畫布","s":"The art teacher gave each of us a large white ________, but I felt nervous because I did not know what to paint.","zh":"美術老師給我們每人一張大大的白色畫布,但我覺得很緊張,因為我不知道要畫什麼。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A2","t":"畫布"},{"w":"easel","pos":"n.","def":"a wooden stand that holds a painting while you work","cn":"畫架","s":"She set up her ________ near the window to catch the morning light, and then she started to paint the old temple.","zh":"她把畫架架在窗邊以捕捉早晨的光線,然後開始畫那座古老的廟宇。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A3","t":"畫架"},{"w":"palette","pos":"n.","def":"a flat board for mixing paint colours","cn":"調色盤","s":"He squeezed some blue and yellow onto his ________, and he mixed them slowly until he got the green colour of the hills.","zh":"他在調色盤上擠了一些藍色和黃色,並慢慢調和,直到調出山丘的綠色。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A4","t":"調色盤"},{"w":"paintbrush","pos":"n.","def":"a brush used for putting paint on a surface","cn":"畫筆","s":"Remember to wash your ________ in clean water after class, or the paint will dry and the hairs will become hard.","zh":"下課後記得用清水洗你的畫筆,否則顏料會乾掉,刷毛會變硬。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A5","t":"畫筆"},{"w":"watercolour","pos":"n.","def":"paint mixed with water; a picture made this way","cn":"水彩","s":"I prefer ________ to oil paint because it dries quickly, but it is hard to fix a mistake once the colour is on paper.","zh":"我比較喜歡水彩而不是油畫顏料,因為它乾得快,但顏色一上紙就很難修改錯誤。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A6","t":"水彩"},{"w":"oil paint","pos":"n.phr.","def":"thick paint made with oil that dries slowly","cn":"油畫顏料","s":"______ ______ takes several days to dry completely, so the artist works on two or three pictures at the same time.","zh":"油畫顏料需要好幾天才能完全乾燥,所以這位畫家會同時進行兩、三幅畫。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A7","t":"油畫顏料"},{"w":"acrylic","pos":"adj.","def":"made with a fast-drying plastic-based paint","cn":"壓克力的","s":"We used ________ paint for the school mural because it is cheap and bright, and it does not wash away in the rain.","zh":"我們用壓克力顏料畫學校的壁畫,因為它便宜又鮮豔,而且不會被雨水沖掉。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A8","t":"壓克力"},{"w":"brushstroke","pos":"n.","def":"a single mark made by a paintbrush","cn":"筆觸","s":"If you stand close to the painting, you can see every thick ________, but from far away the picture looks smooth and calm.","zh":"如果你站在畫作附近,可以看到每一道厚厚的筆觸,但從遠處看,畫面看起來平滑又寧靜。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A9","t":"筆觸"},{"w":"still life","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a picture of objects such as fruit, flowers or bottles","cn":"靜物畫","s":"For homework we had to paint a ______ ______ of fruit on the kitchen table, so I arranged some apples next to a teapot.","zh":"作業是要畫一幅廚房桌上水果的靜物畫,所以我把幾顆蘋果擺在茶壺旁邊。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A10","t":"靜物畫"},{"w":"portrait","pos":"n.","def":"a painting, drawing or photo of a person","cn":"肖像畫","s":"The family asked a local artist to paint a ________ of their grandfather, and they hung it in the living room for his ninetieth birthday.","zh":"這家人請當地一位藝術家為爺爺畫一幅肖像畫,並在他九十歲生日時把它掛在客廳。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A11","t":"肖像畫"},{"w":"self-portrait","pos":"n.","def":"a picture an artist makes of himself or herself","cn":"自畫像","s":"Van Gogh painted more than thirty versions of his ________, because he was poor and could not pay models to sit for him.","zh":"梵谷畫了三十多幅自畫像,因為他很窮,付不起錢請模特兒讓他畫。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A12","t":"自畫像"},{"w":"landscape painting","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a picture of natural scenery such as hills or rivers","cn":"風景畫","s":"Traditional Chinese ______ ______ often shows tiny people under huge mountains, and this reminds viewers how small humans are in nature.","zh":"傳統中國山水風景畫常描繪巨大山脈下渺小的人物,這提醒觀者人類在自然中是多麼渺小。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A13","t":"山水風景畫"},{"w":"mural","pos":"n.","def":"a large picture painted on a wall","cn":"壁畫","s":"Students painted a colourful ________ on the wall of the old train station, and now tourists stop there to take photos.","zh":"學生們在舊火車站的牆上畫了一幅色彩繽紛的壁畫,現在遊客會在那裡停下來拍照。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A14","t":"壁畫"},{"w":"vanishing point","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the point where parallel lines seem to meet far away","cn":"消失點","s":"Draw the road so that both sides meet at one ______ ______ on the horizon, and the street will suddenly look very deep.","zh":"把道路畫成兩側在地平線上的同一個消失點交會,街道就會突然看起來很有深度。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A15","t":"消失點"},{"w":"foreground","pos":"n.","def":"the part of a picture that looks nearest to you","cn":"前景","s":"In the ________ of the photo you can see a small dog, while the mountains stand quietly far behind it.","zh":"在這張照片的前景中你可以看到一隻小狗,而山脈則靜靜地矗立在牠後方遠處。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A16","t":"前景"},{"w":"background","pos":"n.","def":"the part of a picture that looks farthest away","cn":"背景","s":"The girl in the painting wears a red dress, but the ________ is dark grey, so she really stands out.","zh":"畫中的女孩穿著紅色洋裝,但背景是深灰色的,所以她非常突出。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A17","t":"背景"},{"w":"shading","pos":"n.","def":"darker areas in a drawing that show shadow and shape","cn":"陰影明暗","s":"Without any ________, your drawing of the ball looks flat, so add some dark pencil marks on one side.","zh":"沒有任何陰影明暗,你畫的球看起來很扁平,所以在一側加上一些深色鉛筆線條吧。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A18","t":"陰影明暗"},{"w":"hue","pos":"n.","def":"a colour or shade of a colour","cn":"色調;色相","s":"The sky turned a warm orange ________ just before sunset, and the photographer quickly took out his camera.","zh":"就在日落前,天空變成溫暖的橘色色調,攝影師趕緊拿出相機。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A19","t":"色調"},{"w":"primary colour","pos":"n.phr.","def":"red, yellow or blue, which mix to make other colours","cn":"原色","s":"Red is a ______ ______, and when you mix it with yellow you get orange, so you only need a few tubes of paint.","zh":"紅色是一種原色,把它和黃色混合就會得到橘色,所以你只需要幾管顏料。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A20","t":"原色"},{"w":"charcoal","pos":"n.","def":"a black stick of burnt wood used for drawing","cn":"炭筆","s":"He drew the old fisherman's face in ________, and his fingers became completely black by the end of the lesson.","zh":"他用炭筆畫老漁夫的臉,到課程結束時他的手指全都變黑了。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A21","t":"炭筆"},{"w":"pastel","pos":"n.","def":"a soft coloured chalk stick used for drawing","cn":"粉彩筆","s":"My little sister loves drawing with ________ because the colours are soft, but the dust gets all over her clothes.","zh":"我妹妹喜歡用粉彩筆畫畫,因為顏色很柔和,但粉末會沾得她滿身都是。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A22","t":"粉彩筆"},{"w":"sketchbook","pos":"n.","def":"a book of blank pages for drawing","cn":"素描本","s":"She always carries a small ________ in her bag, so she can draw interesting people on the MRT.","zh":"她的包包裡總是帶著一本小素描本,這樣她就能在捷運上畫有趣的人。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A23","t":"素描本"},{"w":"doodle","pos":"v.","def":"to draw small pictures without thinking carefully","cn":"隨手塗鴉","s":"I often ________ in the margins of my notebook during long meetings, but it actually helps me listen better.","zh":"我在冗長的會議中常在筆記本空白處隨手塗鴉,但這其實幫助我聽得更專心。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A24","t":"隨手塗鴉"},{"w":"illustrator","pos":"n.","def":"an artist who draws pictures for books or magazines","cn":"插畫家","s":"The ________ spent six months drawing pictures for the children's book, and the story became much more exciting.","zh":"那位插畫家花了六個月為這本童書繪製插圖,故事因此變得精彩許多。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A25","t":"插畫家"},{"w":"cartoonist","pos":"n.","def":"a person who draws funny pictures or comic strips","cn":"漫畫家","s":"The famous ________ draws a funny picture for the newspaper every day, and readers often laugh about politics because of him.","zh":"這位知名的漫畫家每天為報紙畫一幅有趣的漫畫,讀者常因為他而對政治一笑置之。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A26","t":"漫畫家"},{"w":"frame","pos":"n.","def":"the border of wood or metal around a picture","cn":"畫框","s":"We bought a simple wooden ________ for my daughter's drawing, and now it hangs proudly in the hallway.","zh":"我們為女兒的畫買了一個簡單的木製畫框,現在它驕傲地掛在走廊上。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A27","t":"畫框"},{"w":"tone","pos":"n.","def":"how light or dark a colour is","cn":"色調明暗","s":"The artist used a soft blue ________ for the whole picture, so the scene feels calm and a little sad.","zh":"這位畫家整幅畫都用柔和的藍色色調,所以畫面感覺寧靜又帶點憂傷。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A28","t":"色調"},{"w":"blend","pos":"v.","def":"to mix colours smoothly together","cn":"混合;暈染","s":"Use your finger to ________ the two colours at the edge, and the sky will change gently from pink to purple.","zh":"用手指在邊緣暈染這兩種顏色,天空就會從粉紅色柔和地漸變成紫色。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A29","t":"暈染"},{"w":"colour wheel","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a circle that shows how colours relate to each other","cn":"色相環","s":"Our teacher showed us a ______ ______, and we learned that colours opposite each other look very strong together.","zh":"老師給我們看一個色相環,我們學到彼此相對的顏色放在一起看起來非常強烈。","part":"A","sec":"Painting & Drawing 繪畫與素描","lab":"A30","t":"色相環"},{"w":"sculpture","pos":"n.","def":"a work of art made by shaping stone, wood or metal","cn":"雕塑","s":"A huge metal ________ stands in front of the city hall, and children like to climb on its smooth base.","zh":"一座巨大的金屬雕塑矗立在市政府前,孩子們喜歡爬上它光滑的底座。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A31","t":"雕塑"},{"w":"sculptor","pos":"n.","def":"an artist who makes sculptures","cn":"雕塑家","s":"The ________ worked on the stone lion for two years, but he refused to show anyone until it was finished.","zh":"這位雕塑家花了兩年雕刻這隻石獅,但在完成前他拒絕讓任何人看。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A32","t":"雕塑家"},{"w":"sculpt","pos":"v.","def":"to make a shape from stone, wood or clay","cn":"雕塑;塑造","s":"During the summer camp, the kids learned to ________ animals from soft soap, and they proudly took them home to their parents.","zh":"夏令營期間,孩子們學會用柔軟的肥皂雕塑動物,並驕傲地把作品帶回家給父母。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A33","t":"雕塑"},{"w":"chisel","pos":"n.","def":"a metal tool with a sharp end for cutting wood or stone","cn":"鑿子","s":"He hit the ________ gently with a hammer, and small pieces of wood fell to the floor around him.","zh":"他用鐵鎚輕敲鑿子,小木屑掉落在他周圍的地板上。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A34","t":"鑿子"},{"w":"wax","pos":"n.","def":"a soft substance used to make candles and models","cn":"蠟","s":"The museum shows famous people made of ________, so visitors take selfies with them although they are not real.","zh":"這間博物館展示用蠟做成的名人像,所以雖然他們不是真人,遊客還是會和他們自拍。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A35","t":"蠟"},{"w":"cast / cast / cast","pos":"v.","def":"to make an object by pouring hot metal into a shape","cn":"鑄造","s":"The workers ________ the bronze bell in a special mould, and then they waited a whole week for it to cool down.","zh":"工人們在特製的模具中鑄造這口銅鐘,然後等了一整個星期讓它冷卻。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A36","t":"鑄造"},{"w":"carve","pos":"v.","def":"to cut wood or stone into a shape","cn":"雕刻","s":"My grandfather likes to ________ small birds from old pieces of wood, and he gives them to his grandchildren as gifts.","zh":"我爺爺喜歡用舊木頭雕刻小鳥,並把它們當禮物送給孫子孫女。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A37","t":"雕刻"},{"w":"installation","pos":"n.","def":"a large artwork that fills a room or space","cn":"裝置藝術","s":"The ________ filled the whole room with hanging paper lanterns, so visitors felt as if they were walking through a dream.","zh":"這件裝置藝術用懸掛的紙燈籠填滿整個房間,讓觀眾彷彿走在夢境之中。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A38","t":"裝置藝術"},{"w":"potter","pos":"n.","def":"a person who makes pots and dishes from clay","cn":"陶藝家","s":"The ________ in Yingge let us try making a cup, but mine looked strange because the clay kept moving.","zh":"鶯歌的陶藝家讓我們試做一個杯子,但我的看起來很奇怪,因為陶土一直移動。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A39","t":"陶藝家"},{"w":"potter's wheel","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a turning round plate used to shape clay","cn":"拉坯轉盤","s":"She sat at the ______ ______ for hours, and she slowly shaped the wet clay into a tall, thin vase.","zh":"她在拉坯轉盤前坐了好幾個小時,慢慢把濕陶土塑成一個又高又細的花瓶。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A40","t":"拉坯轉盤"},{"w":"glaze","pos":"n.","def":"a shiny coating put on pottery before it is fired","cn":"釉","s":"After the bowls dried, we painted a blue ________ on them, so they became shiny and waterproof after firing.","zh":"碗乾了之後,我們在上面塗了一層藍色的釉,所以燒製後它們變得光亮又防水。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A41","t":"釉"},{"w":"embroidery","pos":"n.","def":"pictures sewn onto cloth with coloured thread","cn":"刺繡","s":"Her grandmother's ________ shows flowers and birds in bright silk thread, and every tiny stitch was made by hand.","zh":"她奶奶的刺繡用鮮豔的絲線描繪花鳥,每一個小針腳都是手工縫製的。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A42","t":"刺繡"},{"w":"knit","pos":"v.","def":"to make clothes from wool using two long needles","cn":"編織;打毛線","s":"My mother likes to ________ scarves in winter, and she usually gives them to friends before Chinese New Year.","zh":"我媽媽冬天喜歡打毛線織圍巾,而且她通常會在農曆新年前把圍巾送給朋友。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A43","t":"打毛線"},{"w":"quilt","pos":"n.","def":"a warm bed cover made of many pieces of cloth","cn":"拼布被","s":"The women in the village made a ________ from old clothes, and each square tells a story about a family.","zh":"村裡的婦女用舊衣服做了一條拼布被,每一塊方格都訴說著一個家庭的故事。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A44","t":"拼布被"},{"w":"origami","pos":"n.","def":"the Japanese art of folding paper into shapes","cn":"摺紙","s":"We learned ________ in art class and folded a hundred paper cranes, because our classmate was sick in hospital.","zh":"我們在美術課學了摺紙,折了一百隻紙鶴,因為我們的同學生病住院了。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A45","t":"摺紙"},{"w":"paper-cutting","pos":"n.","def":"the art of cutting paper into pretty patterns","cn":"剪紙","s":"Red ________ decorations appear on many windows during Lunar New Year, and they usually show lucky words or animals.","zh":"農曆新年期間,許多窗戶上都會出現紅色的剪紙裝飾,通常是吉祥字或動物圖案。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A46","t":"剪紙"},{"w":"woodcut","pos":"n.","def":"a print made from a picture cut into wood","cn":"木刻版畫","s":"The artist carved the design into a block of wood, and then she pressed it on paper to make a ________.","zh":"這位藝術家把圖案刻在木塊上,然後壓印在紙上製作出一幅木刻版畫。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A47","t":"木刻版畫"},{"w":"stained glass","pos":"n.phr.","def":"coloured glass used to make pictures in windows","cn":"彩繪玻璃","s":"Sunlight shone through the ______ ______ windows of the church, and colourful patterns danced across the floor.","zh":"陽光穿過教堂的彩繪玻璃窗,繽紛的圖案在地板上舞動。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A48","t":"彩繪玻璃"},{"w":"collage","pos":"n.","def":"a picture made by sticking paper and photos onto a surface","cn":"拼貼畫","s":"We cut pictures out of old magazines to make a ________ about our dreams, and the teacher hung them on the classroom wall.","zh":"我們從舊雜誌剪下圖片,做了一幅關於夢想的拼貼畫,老師把它們掛在教室牆上。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A49","t":"拼貼畫"},{"w":"craft fair","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an event where people sell things they have made by hand","cn":"手作市集","s":"I bought a handmade leather wallet at the ______ ______ last weekend, and the seller even printed my name on it.","zh":"上週末我在手作市集買了一個手工皮夾,賣家甚至幫我在上面印了名字。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A50","t":"手作市集"},{"w":"handicraft","pos":"n.","def":"a skilled activity of making things by hand","cn":"手工藝","s":"Many tourists buy local ________ such as bamboo baskets, because they want a real souvenir rather than a cheap plastic toy.","zh":"許多遊客會買竹籃之類的在地手工藝品,因為他們想要真正的紀念品,而不是廉價的塑膠玩具。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A51","t":"手工藝"},{"w":"jewellery","pos":"n.","def":"rings, necklaces and other decorations you wear","cn":"珠寶首飾","s":"She designs silver ________ in her small workshop, and she sells her rings and necklaces online to customers around the world.","zh":"她在小工作室裡設計銀首飾,並在網路上把戒指和項鍊賣給世界各地的顧客。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A52","t":"首飾"},{"w":"goldsmith","pos":"n.","def":"a person who makes things from gold","cn":"金匠","s":"The ________ melted the old gold chain carefully, and then he made it into a beautiful wedding ring for the young couple.","zh":"這位金匠小心地熔化舊金鍊,然後為這對年輕夫妻把它打造成一枚美麗的婚戒。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A53","t":"金匠"},{"w":"lacquer","pos":"n.","def":"a shiny liquid painted on wood to protect and decorate it","cn":"漆","s":"The wooden box is covered with red ________, and it looks so shiny that you can almost see your face in it.","zh":"這個木盒塗滿了紅漆,看起來亮到你幾乎能在上面看到自己的臉。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A54","t":"漆"},{"w":"stencil","pos":"n.","def":"a sheet with a shape cut out, used to paint the same shape","cn":"鏤空模板","s":"The street artist held a ________ against the wall and sprayed paint over it, so the same bird appeared in seconds.","zh":"這位街頭藝術家把鏤空模板貼在牆上並噴漆,同樣的鳥圖案幾秒內就出現了。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A55","t":"鏤空模板"},{"w":"metalwork","pos":"n.","def":"objects made from metal by skilled workers","cn":"金工","s":"The exhibition shows beautiful ________ from old temples, such as bronze lamps and iron gates with flowers on them.","zh":"這個展覽展示了來自古廟的精美金工作品,例如青銅燈和帶有花朵圖案的鐵門。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A56","t":"金工"},{"w":"bust","pos":"n.","def":"a sculpture of a person's head and shoulders","cn":"半身像","s":"A marble ________ of the school's founder stands in the hall, and students sometimes put a hat on it for fun.","zh":"學校創辦人的大理石半身像立在大廳裡,學生有時會為了好玩幫它戴上帽子。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A57","t":"半身像"},{"w":"workmanship","pos":"n.","def":"the skill with which something is made","cn":"做工;手藝","s":"The chair is over a hundred years old, but it is still strong because the ________ is excellent.","zh":"這張椅子已經超過一百歲了,但它依然堅固,因為做工非常精良。","part":"A","sec":"Sculpture, Crafts & Materials 雕塑、工藝與媒材","lab":"A58","t":"做工"},{"w":"Impressionism","pos":"n.","def":"a style of painting that shows light and quick impressions","cn":"印象派","s":"________ began in France in the 1870s, and its painters often worked outdoors to catch changing light on water and fields.","zh":"印象派於1870年代在法國興起,其畫家常在戶外作畫,以捕捉水面和田野上變幻的光線。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A59","t":"印象派"},{"w":"Impressionist","pos":"n.","def":"a painter in the style of Impressionism","cn":"印象派畫家","s":"Monet was a famous ________, and he painted the same pond again and again because the light changed every hour.","zh":"莫內是一位著名的印象派畫家,他一再畫同一座池塘,因為光線每小時都在變化。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A60","t":"印象派畫家"},{"w":"Cubism","pos":"n.","def":"an art style that shows objects as many geometric shapes","cn":"立體派","s":"In ________, a face may be shown from the front and the side at the same time, so the picture can look confusing at first.","zh":"在立體派中,一張臉可能同時從正面和側面呈現,所以畫面一開始可能看起來令人困惑。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A61","t":"立體派"},{"w":"Surrealism","pos":"n.","def":"an art style that shows strange, dreamlike scenes","cn":"超現實主義","s":"________ was inspired by dreams, so its paintings often show melting clocks or fish flying through the sky.","zh":"超現實主義受到夢境啟發,所以它的畫作常出現融化的時鐘或在天空飛翔的魚。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A62","t":"超現實主義"},{"w":"surreal","pos":"adj.","def":"very strange, like a dream","cn":"超現實的;離奇的","s":"Walking through the empty city at dawn felt ________, because the streets that are usually so busy were completely silent.","zh":"黎明時走過空蕩的城市感覺很離奇,因為平常熱鬧的街道完全寂靜無聲。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A63","t":"離奇"},{"w":"Expressionism","pos":"n.","def":"an art style that shows strong feelings rather than real appearance","cn":"表現主義","s":"________ uses wild colours and twisted shapes, because the artists wanted to show fear and anger rather than real faces.","zh":"表現主義使用狂野的色彩和扭曲的形狀,因為藝術家想表現恐懼和憤怒,而不是真實的面孔。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A64","t":"表現主義"},{"w":"pop art","pos":"n.phr.","def":"art that uses images from advertising and popular culture","cn":"普普藝術","s":"______ ______ turned soup cans and comic books into famous paintings, and it made people ask what art really is.","zh":"普普藝術把湯罐頭和漫畫書變成名畫,也讓人們思考藝術究竟是什麼。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A65","t":"普普藝術"},{"w":"realism","pos":"n.","def":"showing things as they really are","cn":"寫實主義","s":"The painter is known for his ________, and his pictures of tired farmers look almost like photographs.","zh":"這位畫家以寫實主義聞名,他筆下疲憊的農民看起來幾乎就像照片一樣。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A66","t":"寫實主義"},{"w":"Romanticism","pos":"n.","def":"an art movement that valued emotion, nature and imagination","cn":"浪漫主義","s":"________ painters loved stormy seas and dark forests, because they believed nature could make people feel strong emotions.","zh":"浪漫主義畫家熱愛暴風雨的海洋和幽暗的森林,因為他們相信大自然能讓人產生強烈的情感。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A67","t":"浪漫主義"},{"w":"Baroque","pos":"adj.","def":"in a rich, dramatic European style of the 1600s","cn":"巴洛克風格的","s":"The ________ church is full of gold decorations and dramatic paintings, so visitors usually look up at the ceiling in silence.","zh":"這座巴洛克風格的教堂到處是金色裝飾和戲劇性的畫作,所以遊客通常會靜靜地抬頭仰望天花板。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A68","t":"巴洛克風格的"},{"w":"Gothic","pos":"adj.","def":"in a medieval style with tall pointed arches","cn":"哥德式的","s":"The ________ cathedral has tall pointed windows, and it took almost two hundred years for the builders to finish it.","zh":"這座哥德式的大教堂有高聳的尖窗,而工匠們花了將近兩百年才完成它。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A69","t":"哥德式的"},{"w":"avant-garde","pos":"adj.","def":"very new and experimental in art or ideas","cn":"前衛的","s":"The theatre group performs ________ plays without any words, so some audiences love them while others leave early.","zh":"這個劇團演出沒有任何台詞的前衛戲劇,所以有些觀眾很喜愛,而有些則提早離場。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A70","t":"前衛"},{"w":"contemporary art","pos":"n.phr.","def":"art made in recent times","cn":"當代藝術","s":"Many people find ______ ______ hard to understand, but the guide explained each work, so our visit became much more interesting.","zh":"許多人覺得當代藝術難以理解,但導覽員解說了每件作品,所以我們的參觀變得有趣多了。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A71","t":"當代藝術"},{"w":"conceptual art","pos":"n.phr.","def":"art in which the idea matters more than the object","cn":"觀念藝術","s":"In ______ ______, the idea behind the work is more important than its skill, so a simple chair can become a serious artwork.","zh":"在觀念藝術中,作品背後的想法比技巧更重要,所以一張簡單的椅子也能成為嚴肅的藝術品。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A72","t":"觀念藝術"},{"w":"modern art","pos":"n.phr.","def":"art from about the 1860s to the 1970s that broke old rules","cn":"現代藝術","s":"My grandfather says that ______ ______ looks like a child's drawing, but my sister explains why the artists broke the old rules.","zh":"我爺爺說現代藝術看起來像小孩的塗鴉,但我姊姊解釋了為什麼藝術家要打破舊規則。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A73","t":"現代藝術"},{"w":"folk art","pos":"n.phr.","def":"traditional art made by ordinary people in a region","cn":"民俗藝術","s":"Hakka ______ ______ includes painted umbrellas and simple cloth patterns, and it shows the daily life of country people.","zh":"客家民俗藝術包括彩繪紙傘和簡樸的布料圖案,展現了鄉村百姓的日常生活。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A74","t":"民俗藝術"},{"w":"art movement","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a group of artists who share ideas and a style for a period","cn":"藝術運動;流派","s":"The young painters started a new ______ ______ in Paris, because they were tired of the strict rules of the art academy.","zh":"這群年輕畫家在巴黎發起一場新的藝術運動,因為他們厭倦了藝術學院的嚴格規範。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A75","t":"藝術運動"},{"w":"genre","pos":"n.","def":"a type of art, music or writing","cn":"類型","s":"Hip-hop is my favourite music ________, but my parents prefer old Taiwanese folk songs from their childhood.","zh":"嘻哈是我最喜歡的音樂類型,但我爸媽比較喜歡他們童年時的台灣老民謠。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A76","t":"類型"},{"w":"style","pos":"n.","def":"a particular way of making art","cn":"風格","s":"Each artist develops a personal ________ over many years, so experts can often recognise a painting before reading the name.","zh":"每位藝術家都要花很多年發展個人風格,所以專家常常在看到名字之前就能認出畫作。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A77","t":"風格"},{"w":"stylistic","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to the style of a work of art","cn":"風格上的","s":"There are clear ________ differences between his early and late paintings, because he lost much of his eyesight in old age.","zh":"他早期和晚期的畫作有明顯的風格上的差異,因為他晚年視力大幅衰退。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A78","t":"風格上的"},{"w":"masterpiece","pos":"n.","def":"an extremely good work of art","cn":"傑作","s":"Many people think the \"Mona Lisa\" is a ________, but some visitors are surprised because the painting is quite small.","zh":"許多人認為《蒙娜麗莎》是一件傑作,但有些參觀者很驚訝,因為這幅畫相當小。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A79","t":"傑作"},{"w":"old master","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a great European painter from before about 1800","cn":"古典大師","s":"The museum owns a painting by an ______ ______ from the 1600s, so it is kept behind thick glass and guarded day and night.","zh":"博物館擁有一幅1600年代古典大師的畫作,所以它被放在厚玻璃後面,日夜都有人看守。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A80","t":"古典大師"},{"w":"virtuoso","pos":"n.","def":"a person with great skill, especially in music","cn":"大師;名家","s":"The young pianist is a real ________, and she can play the most difficult pieces without looking at the music.","zh":"這位年輕鋼琴家是真正的名家,她不看樂譜就能彈奏最困難的曲子。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A81","t":"名家"},{"w":"muse","pos":"n.","def":"a person who gives an artist ideas and inspiration","cn":"繆思;靈感來源","s":"The singer says his wife is his ________, because most of his love songs were written about her.","zh":"這位歌手說他的妻子是他的繆思,因為他大部分的情歌都是為她寫的。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A82","t":"繆思"},{"w":"signature","pos":"n.","def":"an artist's name written on a work","cn":"簽名","s":"Experts checked the ________ in the corner of the painting carefully, because they suspected that the picture was a copy.","zh":"專家仔細檢查畫作角落的簽名,因為他們懷疑這幅畫是複製品。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A83","t":"簽名"},{"w":"bohemian","pos":"adj.","def":"living in an unusual, free way like many artists","cn":"波希米亞風的;放蕩不羈的","s":"They live a ________ life in a small flat full of paintings, and they rarely care about money or fashion.","zh":"他們在堆滿畫作的小公寓裡過著放蕩不羈的生活,而且很少在乎金錢或時尚。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A84","t":"放蕩不羈的"},{"w":"eccentric","pos":"adj.","def":"strange or unusual in behaviour","cn":"古怪的","s":"The ________ artist wore a bright purple suit every day, and he talked to his paintings as if they were friends.","zh":"這位古怪的藝術家每天都穿亮紫色西裝,而且會跟他的畫作說話,彷彿它們是朋友。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A85","t":"古怪的"},{"w":"posthumous","pos":"adj.","def":"happening after a person's death","cn":"死後的","s":"The poet enjoyed ________ fame, because her poems became popular only after she died in poverty.","zh":"這位詩人享有死後的名聲,因為她的詩直到她在貧困中過世後才受歡迎。","part":"A","sec":"Artists, Styles & Movements 藝術家、風格與流派","lab":"A86","t":"死後的"},{"w":"gallery","pos":"n.","def":"a room or building where art is shown or sold","cn":"畫廊;美術館","s":"We visited a small ________ in Taipei that shows young local artists, and the owner told us about each painting.","zh":"我們參觀了台北一家展出在地年輕藝術家作品的小畫廊,老闆向我們介紹了每一幅畫。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A87","t":"畫廊"},{"w":"museum","pos":"n.","def":"a building where valuable objects are kept and shown","cn":"博物館","s":"The National Palace ________ is very crowded in summer, so we went early in the morning to avoid the tour groups.","zh":"國立故宮博物院夏天非常擁擠,所以我們一大早就去,以避開旅行團。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A88","t":"博物院"},{"w":"collection","pos":"n.","def":"a group of objects gathered together","cn":"收藏","s":"The museum's ________ includes more than five thousand paintings, but only a small number can be shown at one time.","zh":"這間博物館的收藏包括五千多幅畫作,但一次只能展出其中一小部分。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A89","t":"收藏"},{"w":"collector","pos":"n.","def":"a person who gathers valuable objects as a hobby","cn":"收藏家","s":"The wealthy ________ bought paintings for fifty years, and before he died he gave all of them to the city.","zh":"這位富有的收藏家買了五十年的畫,並在過世前把它們全部捐給了這座城市。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A90","t":"收藏家"},{"w":"auction","pos":"n.","def":"a public sale where things go to the person who pays most","cn":"拍賣會","s":"The painting was sold at ________ for ten million dollars, and the crowd clapped loudly when the hammer came down.","zh":"這幅畫在拍賣會上以一千萬美元售出,落槌時群眾大聲鼓掌。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A91","t":"拍賣會"},{"w":"auctioneer","pos":"n.","def":"the person who runs an auction","cn":"拍賣官","s":"The ________ spoke very fast and pointed at people who raised their hands, so I was afraid to scratch my head.","zh":"拍賣官說話非常快,並指著舉手的人,所以我連抓頭都不敢。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A92","t":"拍賣官"},{"w":"bid / bid / bid","pos":"v.","def":"to offer a price for something at an auction","cn":"出價;競標","s":"Two collectors ________ against each other for the old vase, and the price rose higher and higher every few seconds.","zh":"兩位收藏家為這只古花瓶互相競標,價格每隔幾秒就越抬越高。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A93","t":"競標"},{"w":"bidder","pos":"n.","def":"a person who offers money at an auction","cn":"競標者","s":"The painting went to an unknown ________ on the telephone, so nobody in the room knew who the new owner was.","zh":"這幅畫由一位透過電話出價的匿名競標者得標,所以現場沒有人知道新主人是誰。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A94","t":"競標者"},{"w":"art dealer","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person who buys and sells works of art","cn":"藝術經紀商;畫商","s":"An ______ ______ noticed her paintings online, and he offered to sell them in his gallery in Hong Kong.","zh":"一位畫商在網路上注意到她的畫作,並提議在他香港的畫廊販售。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A95","t":"畫商"},{"w":"valuation","pos":"n.","def":"a judgement of how much something is worth","cn":"估價","s":"We took grandma's old painting for a ________, but the expert said it was worth only a few hundred dollars.","zh":"我們把奶奶的舊畫拿去估價,但專家說它只值幾百元。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A96","t":"估價"},{"w":"priceless","pos":"adj.","def":"so valuable that no price can be put on it","cn":"無價的","s":"The museum's ancient scrolls are ________, so they are kept in dark rooms where the temperature never changes.","zh":"博物館的古代卷軸是無價的,所以它們被保存在溫度從不變化的暗室裡。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A97","t":"無價的"},{"w":"authenticate","pos":"v.","def":"to prove that something is real and not a copy","cn":"鑑定真偽","s":"Experts used X-rays to ________ the painting, and they found an older picture hidden under the paint.","zh":"專家使用X光來鑑定這幅畫的真偽,結果發現顏料底下藏著一幅更早的畫。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A98","t":"鑑定 真偽"},{"w":"conservator","pos":"n.","def":"a person who repairs and protects old works of art","cn":"文物修復師","s":"The ________ spent months cleaning the dirty painting with tiny brushes, and the bright colours slowly appeared again.","zh":"這位文物修復師花了好幾個月用小刷子清理骯髒的畫作,鮮豔的色彩慢慢重新顯現。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A99","t":"文物修復師"},{"w":"guided tour","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a visit led by a person who explains things","cn":"導覽","s":"We joined a free ______ ______ of the museum, and the guide told us funny stories about the artists' lives.","zh":"我們參加了博物館的免費導覽,導覽員告訴我們藝術家生活中的趣事。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A100","t":"導覽"},{"w":"docent","pos":"n.","def":"a trained guide who explains art in a museum","cn":"導覽員","s":"The ________ at the art museum is a retired teacher, and she explains the paintings so clearly that even children listen carefully.","zh":"美術館的導覽員是一位退休老師,她解說畫作清楚到連孩子都認真聆聽。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A101","t":"導覽員"},{"w":"audio guide","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a recorded talk you listen to as you walk round a museum","cn":"語音導覽","s":"I rented an ______ ______ at the entrance, so I could listen to information about each painting in Chinese.","zh":"我在入口租了一台語音導覽,這樣就能聽到每幅畫的中文介紹。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A102","t":"語音導覽"},{"w":"gift shop","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a shop in a museum that sells souvenirs","cn":"紀念品店","s":"After the exhibition we went to the ______ ______, and I bought postcards of my favourite paintings for my friends.","zh":"看完展覽後我們去了紀念品店,我買了我最喜歡的畫作明信片送給朋友。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A103","t":"紀念品店"},{"w":"opening night","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the first evening of an exhibition or show","cn":"開幕夜;首演之夜","s":"Hundreds of guests came to the ______ ______ of her first exhibition, but she was so nervous that she hid in the bathroom.","zh":"數百位賓客出席她首次個展的開幕夜,但她緊張到躲進了廁所。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A104","t":"開幕夜"},{"w":"art fair","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a large event where galleries show and sell art","cn":"藝術博覽會","s":"Galleries from twenty countries come to the ______ ______ in Taipei every year, and collectors fly in to buy new works.","zh":"每年有來自二十個國家的畫廊參加台北的藝術博覽會,收藏家也會搭機前來購買新作品。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A105","t":"藝術博覽會"},{"w":"biennale","pos":"n.","def":"a large art exhibition held every two years","cn":"雙年展","s":"The famous ________ in Venice takes place every two years, and artists from all over the world hope to be invited.","zh":"威尼斯著名的雙年展每兩年舉辦一次,世界各地的藝術家都希望受邀參展。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A106","t":"雙年展"},{"w":"art critic","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person who writes opinions about art","cn":"藝評家","s":"One well-known ______ ______ called the exhibition boring, but thousands of young visitors still queued to see it.","zh":"一位知名藝評家說這個展覽很無聊,但仍有數千名年輕觀眾排隊參觀。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A107","t":"藝評家"},{"w":"loan","pos":"n.","def":"something borrowed for a period of time","cn":"出借;借展","s":"The famous painting is on ________ from a museum in Paris, so it will return to France after three months.","zh":"這幅名畫是巴黎一家博物館借展的,所以三個月後會回到法國。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A108","t":"借展"},{"w":"heist","pos":"n.","def":"a carefully planned robbery","cn":"搶劫;竊案","s":"Thieves stole thirteen paintings in a famous art ________ in 1990, and the frames still hang empty on the museum wall.","zh":"竊賊在1990年一起著名的藝術品竊案中偷走了十三幅畫,那些空畫框至今仍掛在博物館牆上。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A109","t":"竊案"},{"w":"vandalise","pos":"v.","def":"to damage property on purpose","cn":"蓄意破壞","s":"Someone tried to ________ the statue in the park last night, so the city has decided to put up cameras.","zh":"昨晚有人試圖蓄意破壞公園裡的雕像,所以市政府決定裝設監視器。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A110","t":"蓄意破壞"},{"w":"pedestal","pos":"n.","def":"a base on which a statue stands","cn":"底座;基座","s":"The small bronze horse stands on a tall stone ________, so visitors can look at it at eye level.","zh":"這匹小銅馬立在高高的石頭底座上,所以參觀者能平視欣賞它。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A111","t":"底座"},{"w":"spotlight","pos":"n.","def":"a strong light pointed at one thing","cn":"聚光燈","s":"A single ________ shone on the painting in the dark room, and it made the gold colours glow beautifully.","zh":"一盞聚光燈照在暗室中的畫作上,讓金色光彩美麗地閃耀。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A112","t":"聚光燈"},{"w":"art market","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the buying and selling of art","cn":"藝術市場","s":"The ______ ______ in Asia has grown quickly, because more young people now see paintings as a good investment.","zh":"亞洲的藝術市場成長迅速,因為現在更多年輕人把畫作視為好的投資。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A113","t":"藝術市場"},{"w":"price tag","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the cost of something","cn":"價格;標價","s":"The sculpture has a ______ ______ of two million dollars, but the gallery says several buyers are already interested.","zh":"這件雕塑的標價是兩百萬美元,但畫廊表示已經有好幾位買家感興趣。","part":"A","sec":"Galleries, Museums & the Art Market 美術館、博物館與藝術市場","lab":"A114","t":"標價"},{"w":"creativity","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to make new and original things","cn":"創造力","s":"The new art programme aims to develop students' ________, so there are no right or wrong answers in class.","zh":"新的藝術課程旨在培養學生的創造力,所以課堂上沒有標準答案。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A115","t":"創造力"},{"w":"creative","pos":"adj.","def":"good at thinking of new ideas or making things","cn":"有創意的","s":"My cousin is very ________, and she turned old jeans into a bag that everyone at school wanted to buy.","zh":"我表妹非常有創意,她把舊牛仔褲改成一個全校都想買的包包。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A116","t":"有創意"},{"w":"creator","pos":"n.","def":"a person who makes something new","cn":"創作者","s":"The ________ of the popular cartoon was only twenty years old, but his drawings soon appeared on T-shirts everywhere.","zh":"這部熱門卡通的創作者只有二十歲,但他的畫很快就出現在各地的T恤上。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A117","t":"創作者"},{"w":"imagination","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to form pictures and ideas in your mind","cn":"想像力","s":"Children have a wonderful ________, and a simple cardboard box can become a spaceship or a castle in their games.","zh":"孩子們擁有奇妙的想像力,一個簡單的紙箱在他們的遊戲中就能變成太空船或城堡。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A118","t":"想像力"},{"w":"imagine","pos":"v.","def":"to form a picture of something in your mind","cn":"想像","s":"Close your eyes and ________ a quiet beach at sunset, and then try to paint the colours you see.","zh":"閉上眼睛想像日落時寧靜的海灘,然後試著畫出你看到的顏色。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A119","t":"想像"},{"w":"inspire","pos":"v.","def":"to give someone the wish or idea to do something","cn":"啟發;激勵","s":"Her trip to Morocco helped ________ a new series of paintings, because the markets were full of bright colours.","zh":"她的摩洛哥之旅啟發了一系列新畫作,因為那裡的市集充滿鮮豔的色彩。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A120","t":"啟發"},{"w":"inspired","pos":"adj.","def":"having excellent, original qualities","cn":"靈感十足的;絕妙的","s":"The director's ________ choice of music made the sad scene unforgettable, and many people in the cinema began to cry.","zh":"導演絕妙的配樂選擇讓這悲傷的一幕令人難忘,電影院裡許多人都哭了。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A121","t":"絕妙的"},{"w":"original","pos":"adj.","def":"new and different from anything before","cn":"原創的;獨創的","s":"The judges wanted ________ designs, so they rejected any poster that looked like something on the internet.","zh":"評審想要原創的設計,所以他們淘汰了任何看起來像網路上作品的海報。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A122","t":"原創的"},{"w":"daydream","pos":"v.","def":"to think pleasant thoughts that take you away from the present","cn":"做白日夢","s":"I often ________ on the bus about future trips, but sometimes I miss my stop because I am not paying attention.","zh":"我常在公車上做白日夢想著未來的旅行,但有時因為不專心而坐過站。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A123","t":"做白日夢"},{"w":"improvise","pos":"v.","def":"to make or perform something without preparation","cn":"即興創作;臨場發揮","s":"The actor forgot his lines, so he had to ________, and the audience laughed because they thought it was part of the play.","zh":"這位演員忘了台詞,所以他只好臨場發揮,觀眾都笑了,因為他們以為那是劇情的一部分。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A124","t":"臨場發揮"},{"w":"improvisation","pos":"n.","def":"performing without planning beforehand","cn":"即興表演","s":"Jazz musicians are famous for ________, because they often create new tunes on stage without any written music.","zh":"爵士樂手以即興表演聞名,因為他們常在台上不看樂譜就創作新曲調。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A125","t":"即興表演"},{"w":"spontaneity","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of acting naturally without planning","cn":"自發性;隨性","s":"Children's drawings are full of ________, while adults often worry too much about making mistakes.","zh":"孩子的畫充滿隨性,而大人往往太擔心犯錯。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A126","t":"隨性"},{"w":"flair","pos":"n.","def":"a natural ability to do something well","cn":"天分;才華","s":"She has a real ________ for design, and even her simple school projects look like professional magazine pages.","zh":"她在設計方面很有天分,就連她簡單的學校作業看起來都像專業雜誌的版面。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A127","t":"天分"},{"w":"talent","pos":"n.","def":"a natural ability to do something well","cn":"天賦","s":"He showed a great ________ for drawing when he was five, so his parents sent him to art classes every Saturday.","zh":"他五歲時就展現出很高的繪畫天賦,所以父母每週六都送他去上美術課。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A128","t":"天賦"},{"w":"artistic","pos":"adj.","def":"showing skill in art","cn":"有藝術天分的;藝術的","s":"My brother is very ________, but he chose to study engineering because he worried about finding a job.","zh":"我哥哥很有藝術天分,但他選擇念工程,因為他擔心找不到工作。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A129","t":"有藝術天分"},{"w":"self-expression","pos":"n.","def":"showing your feelings and ideas through art or actions","cn":"自我表達","s":"Dance is a form of ________ for many teenagers, because they can show feelings that are hard to put into words.","zh":"對許多青少年來說,舞蹈是一種自我表達的方式,因為他們能展現難以言喻的感受。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A130","t":"自我表達"},{"w":"divergent thinking","pos":"n.phr.","def":"thinking of many different answers to one problem","cn":"擴散性思考","s":"The teacher asked us to list fifty uses for a paper clip, because this exercise trains ______ ______.","zh":"老師要我們列出迴紋針的五十種用途,因為這個練習能訓練擴散性思考。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A131","t":"擴散性思考"},{"w":"lateral thinking","pos":"n.phr.","def":"solving problems in unusual and creative ways","cn":"水平思考","s":"The puzzle seemed impossible, but ______ ______ helped us find a surprising answer that nobody expected.","zh":"這道謎題似乎無解,但水平思考幫助我們找到一個出乎所有人意料的答案。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A132","t":"水平思考"},{"w":"eureka moment","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a sudden moment when you find a great idea","cn":"靈光乍現的時刻","s":"The designer had a ______ ______ in the shower, and she quickly wrote her idea on the steamy mirror.","zh":"這位設計師在洗澡時靈光乍現,她趕緊把想法寫在起霧的鏡子上。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A133","t":"靈光乍現"},{"w":"creative block","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a time when you cannot produce new ideas","cn":"創作瓶頸","s":"The songwriter suffered from a ______ ______ for months, so he travelled to the mountains to find fresh ideas.","zh":"這位詞曲創作者陷入創作瓶頸好幾個月,所以他到山上旅行尋找新靈感。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A134","t":"創作瓶頸"},{"w":"writer's block","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a time when a writer cannot think what to write","cn":"寫作瓶頸","s":"I had ______ ______ when I started my essay, but going for a short walk helped me think again.","zh":"我開始寫論文時遇到寫作瓶頸,但出去散步一下幫助我重新思考。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A135","t":"寫作瓶頸"},{"w":"playful","pos":"adj.","def":"full of fun and not serious","cn":"好玩的;俏皮的","s":"The artist uses ________ shapes and bright colours, so even serious adults smile when they walk into her exhibition.","zh":"這位藝術家運用俏皮的形狀和鮮豔的色彩,所以就連嚴肅的大人走進她的展覽也會微笑。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A136","t":"俏皮的"},{"w":"flow","pos":"n.","def":"a happy state of complete focus on an activity","cn":"心流","s":"When I paint, I sometimes enter a state of ________, and three hours pass without me noticing the time.","zh":"我畫畫時有時會進入心流狀態,三個小時過去了我卻沒注意到時間。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A137","t":"心流"},{"w":"curious","pos":"adj.","def":"wanting to know or learn about something","cn":"好奇的","s":"Good designers are always ________ about how things work, so they ask many questions before they start drawing.","zh":"好的設計師總是對事物如何運作感到好奇,所以他們在開始畫之前會問很多問題。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A138","t":"好奇"},{"w":"open-minded","pos":"adj.","def":"willing to accept new and different ideas","cn":"心胸開闊的","s":"Try to be ________ when you visit a modern art museum, because some works look strange but have interesting meanings.","zh":"參觀現代美術館時試著保持心胸開闊,因為有些作品看起來很怪,卻有有趣的含義。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A139","t":"心胸開闊"},{"w":"risk-taking","pos":"n.","def":"doing things that might fail in order to achieve something","cn":"冒險","s":"Creative work often needs a little ________, because many new ideas fail several times before they finally succeed.","zh":"創作工作常常需要一點冒險,因為許多新點子在最終成功前會失敗好幾次。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A140","t":"冒險"},{"w":"mood board","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a collection of pictures and colours used to plan a design","cn":"情緒板;靈感板","s":"Before designing the café, she made a ______ ______ with photos of plants and wood, so the owner could see her ideas.","zh":"在設計咖啡廳之前,她做了一塊貼滿植物與木頭照片的靈感板,讓老闆能看到她的構想。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A141","t":"靈感板"},{"w":"creative process","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the steps people follow to make something new","cn":"創作過程","s":"Every artist has a different ______ ______, and some begin with careful plans while others simply start painting.","zh":"每位藝術家都有不同的創作過程,有些人從周密的計畫開始,而有些人則直接動筆。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A142","t":"創作過程"},{"w":"craft","pos":"v.","def":"to make something skilfully","cn":"精心製作","s":"She spent weeks trying to ________ the perfect opening line for her novel, but she rewrote it many times.","zh":"她花了好幾週試圖精心寫出小說完美的開場白,但她改寫了很多次。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A143","t":"精心寫出"},{"w":"rework","pos":"v.","def":"to change something in order to improve it","cn":"修改;重做","s":"The editor asked the author to ________ the ending, because readers found it too sad and confusing.","zh":"編輯請作者修改結局,因為讀者覺得它太悲傷又令人困惑。","part":"A","sec":"Creativity & the Creative Process 創造力與創作過程","lab":"A144","t":"修改"},{"w":"photographer","pos":"n.","def":"a person who takes photographs, often as a job","cn":"攝影師","s":"The wedding ________ asked everyone to stand closer together, and then he climbed on a chair to take a group photo.","zh":"婚禮攝影師請大家站近一點,然後他爬上椅子拍了一張團體照。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A145","t":"攝影師"},{"w":"photography","pos":"n.","def":"the art or job of taking photos","cn":"攝影","s":"He became interested in ________ when his grandfather gave him an old film camera on his sixteenth birthday.","zh":"他在爺爺於他十六歲生日送他一台舊底片相機後,開始對攝影產生興趣。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A146","t":"攝影"},{"w":"snapshot","pos":"n.","def":"a quick, informal photo","cn":"快照;隨手拍","s":"I took a quick ________ of my friends at the night market, and it became my favourite photo of the whole trip.","zh":"我在夜市幫朋友隨手拍了一張照片,它成了整趟旅行中我最喜歡的照片。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A147","t":"隨手拍"},{"w":"tripod","pos":"n.","def":"a three-legged stand that holds a camera steady","cn":"三腳架","s":"You need a ________ to photograph stars at night, because even a tiny movement of your hands will make the picture blurry.","zh":"晚上拍星星需要三腳架,因為即使手稍微晃動都會讓照片模糊。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A148","t":"三腳架"},{"w":"shutter","pos":"n.","def":"the part of a camera that opens to let in light","cn":"快門","s":"Press the ________ button gently when the bird opens its wings, or you might miss the perfect moment.","zh":"在鳥張開翅膀時輕按快門鍵,否則你可能會錯過完美的瞬間。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A149","t":"快門"},{"w":"aperture","pos":"n.","def":"the hole in a camera lens that controls light","cn":"光圈","s":"A wide ________ lets in more light, so it is useful when you take photos in a dark restaurant.","zh":"大光圈能讓更多光線進入,所以在昏暗的餐廳拍照時很有用。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A150","t":"光圈"},{"w":"zoom","pos":"v.","def":"to make something look closer with a camera","cn":"拉近;放大","s":"The photographer had to ________ in on the shy deer, because it would run away if he walked any closer.","zh":"攝影師必須把鏡頭拉近拍那隻害羞的鹿,因為他再走近一點牠就會跑掉。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A151","t":"拉近"},{"w":"close-up","pos":"n.","def":"a photo taken from very near","cn":"特寫","s":"The film begins with a ________ of the girl's eyes, so the audience immediately feels her fear.","zh":"這部電影以女孩雙眼的特寫開場,所以觀眾立刻感受到她的恐懼。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A152","t":"特寫"},{"w":"flash","pos":"n.","def":"a bright light on a camera for dark places","cn":"閃光燈","s":"Please turn off your ________ inside the museum, because strong light can slowly damage old paintings.","zh":"在博物館裡請關閉閃光燈,因為強光會慢慢損害古老的畫作。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A153","t":"閃光燈"},{"w":"darkroom","pos":"n.","def":"a dark room for developing film photos","cn":"暗房","s":"In the school ________, we watched the picture slowly appear on the paper, and it felt like magic.","zh":"在學校的暗房裡,我們看著影像慢慢浮現在相紙上,感覺就像魔法一樣。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A154","t":"暗房"},{"w":"black-and-white","pos":"adj.","def":"showing only black, white and grey","cn":"黑白的","s":"She prefers ________ photos of old streets, because she thinks colour makes them look too modern.","zh":"她比較喜歡老街的黑白照片,因為她認為彩色會讓它們看起來太現代。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A155","t":"黑白"},{"w":"graphic design","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the art of combining words and pictures for posters, websites etc.","cn":"平面設計","s":"My sister studies ______ ______ at university, and she designed the logo for our family's noodle shop.","zh":"我姊姊在大學念平面設計,她為我們家的麵店設計了招牌標誌。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A156","t":"平面設計"},{"w":"graphic designer","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person who designs posters, books or websites","cn":"平面設計師","s":"The company hired a ______ ______ to make its website look modern, and sales rose within a few months.","zh":"這家公司聘請了一位平面設計師讓網站看起來更現代,幾個月內業績就上升了。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A157","t":"平面設計師"},{"w":"typography","pos":"n.","def":"the style and arrangement of printed letters","cn":"字體排印","s":"Good ________ makes a menu easy to read, but a strange font can make customers feel confused.","zh":"好的字體排印讓菜單容易閱讀,但奇怪的字型會讓顧客感到困惑。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A158","t":"字體排印"},{"w":"font","pos":"n.","def":"a set of letters in one style and size","cn":"字型","s":"Please use a simple ________ for your report, because the fancy one is hard for the teacher to read.","zh":"你的報告請用簡單的字型,因為花俏的字型老師很難閱讀。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A159","t":"字型"},{"w":"colour scheme","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the set of colours chosen for a design","cn":"配色","s":"We chose a calm ______ ______ of light blue and white for the bedroom, so it feels peaceful at night.","zh":"我們為臥室選了淺藍和白色的沉穩配色,所以晚上感覺很寧靜。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A160","t":"配色"},{"w":"digital art","pos":"n.phr.","def":"art made with computers or tablets","cn":"數位藝術","s":"______ ______ has become very popular with teenagers, because they can draw on a tablet and share the work online at once.","zh":"數位藝術在青少年間變得非常受歡迎,因為他們能在平板上作畫並立刻上網分享。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A161","t":"數位藝術"},{"w":"pixel","pos":"n.","def":"one of the tiny dots that make a digital image","cn":"像素","s":"If you make the photo too large, you will see every ________, so the picture will look blocky.","zh":"如果你把照片放得太大,就會看到每一個像素,所以畫面會看起來像方塊。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A162","t":"像素"},{"w":"animation","pos":"n.","def":"moving pictures made from drawings or computer images","cn":"動畫","s":"Japanese ________ is loved around the world, and some films take years to finish because every scene is drawn by hand.","zh":"日本動畫受到全世界喜愛,有些電影要花數年才能完成,因為每一幕都是手繪的。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A163","t":"動畫"},{"w":"animator","pos":"n.","def":"a person who makes animated films","cn":"動畫師","s":"The ________ drew twelve pictures for every second of the film, so a short scene took him several weeks.","zh":"這位動畫師為影片的每一秒畫了十二張圖,所以一個短短的場景就花了他好幾週。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A164","t":"動畫師"},{"w":"NFT","pos":"n.","def":"a digital certificate that shows who owns a digital artwork","cn":"非同質化代幣","s":"He sold a cartoon cat as an ________ for a lot of money, but a year later nobody wanted to buy it.","zh":"他把一隻卡通貓以非同質化代幣的形式賣了很多錢,但一年後就沒人想買了。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A165","t":"非同質化代幣"},{"w":"AI-generated","pos":"adj.","def":"made by artificial intelligence, not a person","cn":"人工智慧生成的","s":"The ________ picture won first prize in the contest, so many human artists complained that the result was unfair.","zh":"那幅人工智慧生成的圖片在比賽中贏得首獎,所以許多人類藝術家抱怨結果不公平。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A166","t":"人工智慧生成的"},{"w":"retouch","pos":"v.","def":"to improve a photo by making small changes","cn":"修圖","s":"Magazines often ________ photos of models to hide spots, but this gives young readers unrealistic ideas about beauty.","zh":"雜誌常修圖遮掉模特兒臉上的斑點,但這讓年輕讀者對美產生不切實際的想法。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A167","t":"修圖"},{"w":"photo shoot","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a session when a photographer takes many photos","cn":"拍攝工作","s":"The band had a ______ ______ on the beach for their new album, but the strong wind kept blowing the singer's hair.","zh":"樂團為新專輯在海灘進行拍攝工作,但強風一直吹亂主唱的頭髮。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A168","t":"拍攝工作"},{"w":"stylus","pos":"n.","def":"a pen-shaped tool for drawing on a screen","cn":"觸控筆","s":"She draws her comics with a ________ on a tablet, so she can easily fix mistakes with one click.","zh":"她用觸控筆在平板上畫漫畫,所以只要點一下就能輕鬆修正錯誤。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A169","t":"觸控筆"},{"w":"visual effects","pos":"n.phr.","def":"images added to films by computer","cn":"視覺特效","s":"The film used amazing ______ ______ to show dragons flying over the city, and it won an award for them.","zh":"這部電影運用驚人的視覺特效呈現飛越城市的巨龍,並因此獲獎。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A170","t":"視覺特效"},{"w":"cartoon","pos":"n.","def":"a funny drawing or animated film","cn":"卡通;漫畫","s":"My little brother watches a ________ every morning before school, and he copies the characters' funny voices all day.","zh":"我弟弟每天早上上學前都會看一部卡通,然後一整天模仿角色的搞笑聲音。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A171","t":"卡通"},{"w":"comic book","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a magazine that tells stories in pictures","cn":"漫畫書","s":"I learned many English words from reading a ______ ______ every week, because the pictures helped me guess the meanings.","zh":"我每週讀一本漫畫書,從中學到很多英文單字,因為圖片幫助我猜出意思。","part":"A","sec":"Photography, Design & Digital Art 攝影、設計與數位藝術","lab":"A172","t":"漫畫書"},{"w":"performance","pos":"n.","def":"the act of entertaining an audience","cn":"表演;演出","s":"Her ________ in the school play was so moving that several parents wiped tears from their eyes.","zh":"她在學校話劇中的演出非常感人,好幾位家長都擦了眼淚。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A173","t":"演出"},{"w":"performer","pos":"n.","def":"a person who entertains an audience","cn":"表演者","s":"Each ________ at the festival had only ten minutes on stage, so they practised their acts many times.","zh":"節慶上每位表演者只有十分鐘的上台時間,所以他們把表演練習了很多次。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A174","t":"表演者"},{"w":"theatre","pos":"n.","def":"a building where plays are performed","cn":"劇院","s":"We went to the ________ to see a musical on Saturday, but the tickets were so expensive that we sat in the back row.","zh":"週六我們去劇院看音樂劇,但票價太貴了,所以我們坐在最後一排。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A175","t":"劇院"},{"w":"playwright","pos":"n.","def":"a person who writes plays","cn":"劇作家","s":"The young ________ wrote a play about her grandmother's life, and it sold out every night for a month.","zh":"這位年輕劇作家寫了一齣關於她奶奶一生的戲,連續一個月每晚都售罄。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A176","t":"劇作家"},{"w":"rehearse","pos":"v.","def":"to practise a play or music before a performance","cn":"排練","s":"The choir had to ________ every evening for a month, because the concert was only a few weeks away.","zh":"合唱團一個月來每晚都得排練,因為音樂會只剩幾週了。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A177","t":"排練"},{"w":"backstage","pos":"adv.","def":"behind the stage in a theatre","cn":"在後台","s":"The dancers waited nervously ________ before the show, while the audience slowly found their seats.","zh":"演出前舞者們緊張地在後台等待,而觀眾則慢慢找到座位。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A178","t":"在後台"},{"w":"audition","pos":"n.","def":"a short performance to get a role in a show","cn":"試鏡;甄選","s":"She practised the song for weeks before the ________, and she was thrilled when she got the main role.","zh":"她在試鏡前把那首歌練了好幾週,當她拿到主角時非常興奮。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A179","t":"試鏡"},{"w":"choreographer","pos":"n.","def":"a person who plans the movements of a dance","cn":"編舞家","s":"The ________ changed the dance three times in one week, so the dancers felt exhausted and confused.","zh":"編舞家一週內改了三次舞步,所以舞者們感到筋疲力盡又困惑。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A180","t":"編舞家"},{"w":"choreography","pos":"n.","def":"the planned steps and movements of a dance","cn":"編舞;舞步設計","s":"The ________ of the K-pop song is very difficult, but thousands of fans have learned it from online videos.","zh":"這首韓流歌曲的舞步設計非常困難,但數千名粉絲已經透過網路影片學會了。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A181","t":"舞步設計"},{"w":"ballet","pos":"n.","def":"a graceful type of dance that tells a story","cn":"芭蕾舞","s":"My niece has taken ________ lessons since she was four, and she dreams of dancing in \"Swan Lake\" one day.","zh":"我姪女從四歲就開始上芭蕾舞課,她夢想有一天能在《天鵝湖》中跳舞。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A182","t":"芭蕾舞"},{"w":"orchestra","pos":"n.","def":"a large group of musicians who play together","cn":"管弦樂團","s":"The school ________ has sixty students, and they play a free concert in the park every spring.","zh":"學校的管弦樂團有六十名學生,他們每年春天都會在公園舉辦免費音樂會。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A183","t":"管弦樂團"},{"w":"composer","pos":"n.","def":"a person who writes music","cn":"作曲家","s":"The film's ________ wrote the music in only three weeks, but it became one of the most famous soundtracks in the world.","zh":"這部電影的作曲家只花三週就寫完配樂,但它成為世上最著名的電影原聲帶之一。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A184","t":"作曲家"},{"w":"compose","pos":"v.","def":"to write music","cn":"作曲","s":"Mozart began to ________ music when he was five, and he wrote more than six hundred pieces in his short life.","zh":"莫札特五歲就開始作曲,他在短暫的一生中寫了六百多首作品。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A185","t":"作曲"},{"w":"melody","pos":"n.","def":"a tune; a series of musical notes","cn":"旋律","s":"The ________ of the song is very simple, so even small children can sing it after hearing it once.","zh":"這首歌的旋律非常簡單,所以連小孩子聽一次就會唱。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A186","t":"旋律"},{"w":"harmony","pos":"n.","def":"pleasant musical notes sung or played together","cn":"和聲","s":"The four singers practised their ________ for hours, and their voices finally sounded like one beautiful voice.","zh":"四位歌手練習和聲好幾個小時,他們的聲音終於聽起來像一個美麗的聲音。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A187","t":"和聲"},{"w":"lyrics","pos":"n.","def":"the words of a song","cn":"歌詞","s":"I love the tune, but I cannot understand the ________, so I looked them up online and translated them.","zh":"我喜歡這個曲調,但聽不懂歌詞,所以我上網查了並把它們翻譯出來。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A188","t":"歌詞"},{"w":"symphony","pos":"n.","def":"a long piece of music for an orchestra","cn":"交響曲","s":"Beethoven wrote his ninth ________ when he was almost completely deaf, and it is still played all over the world.","zh":"貝多芬在幾乎全聾時寫下他的第九號交響曲,至今仍在世界各地演奏。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A189","t":"交響曲"},{"w":"concert","pos":"n.","def":"a musical performance in front of an audience","cn":"音樂會;演唱會","s":"Thousands of fans waited outside the stadium all day, because the ________ was the band's last in Taiwan.","zh":"數千名粉絲整天在體育場外等待,因為這場演唱會是樂團在台灣的最後一場。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A190","t":"演唱會"},{"w":"musician","pos":"n.","def":"a person who plays or writes music","cn":"音樂家","s":"The street ________ played the violin every evening near the station, and many commuters stopped to listen on their way home.","zh":"這位街頭音樂家每晚在車站附近拉小提琴,許多通勤族在回家途中停下來聆聽。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A191","t":"音樂家"},{"w":"instrument","pos":"n.","def":"an object such as a piano or guitar used to make music","cn":"樂器","s":"Learning a musical ________ takes years of practice, but it can also improve your memory and patience.","zh":"學習一種樂器需要多年練習,但它也能改善你的記憶力和耐心。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A192","t":"樂器"},{"w":"opera","pos":"n.","def":"a play in which the words are sung with an orchestra","cn":"歌劇","s":"Taiwanese ________ is performed on outdoor stages near temples, and the actors wear colourful costumes and heavy make-up.","zh":"台灣歌仔戲在廟宇附近的戶外舞台演出,演員穿著色彩繽紛的戲服、畫著濃妝。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A193","t":"歌仔戲"},{"w":"musical","pos":"n.","def":"a play or film with many songs and dances","cn":"音樂劇","s":"We saw a Broadway ________ in New York, and I could not stop singing its songs for weeks after the trip.","zh":"我們在紐約看了一齣百老匯音樂劇,旅行結束後好幾週我都忍不住哼唱裡面的歌。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A194","t":"音樂劇"},{"w":"applause","pos":"n.","def":"the sound of people clapping","cn":"掌聲","s":"The ________ continued for five minutes after the show ended, so the actors came back on stage three times.","zh":"演出結束後掌聲持續了五分鐘,所以演員們回到台上謝幕了三次。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A195","t":"掌聲"},{"w":"standing ovation","pos":"n.phr.","def":"when an audience stands up to clap for a long time","cn":"起立鼓掌","s":"The old pianist received a ______ ______ after her last concert, and she bowed with tears in her eyes.","zh":"這位年邁的鋼琴家在最後一場音樂會後獲得全場起立鼓掌,她眼含淚水鞠躬致意。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A196","t":"起立鼓掌"},{"w":"encore","pos":"n.","def":"an extra song performed because the audience asks for it","cn":"安可曲","s":"The crowd shouted for an ________, so the band came back and played their most famous song once more.","zh":"觀眾大喊要安可曲,所以樂團回到台上再演奏了一次他們最有名的歌。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A197","t":"安可曲"},{"w":"premiere","pos":"n.","def":"the first public performance of a film or play","cn":"首映;首演","s":"The actors walked on the red carpet at the film's ________, while fans screamed and took photos behind the barriers.","zh":"演員們在電影首映會上走紅毯,而粉絲們在圍欄後尖叫拍照。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A198","t":"首映"},{"w":"busker","pos":"n.","def":"a person who performs music in the street for money","cn":"街頭藝人","s":"A talented ________ was singing outside the department store, and people dropped coins into his guitar case.","zh":"一位有才華的街頭藝人在百貨公司外唱歌,人們把硬幣丟進他的吉他盒裡。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A199","t":"街頭藝人"},{"w":"costume","pos":"n.","def":"clothes worn by actors in a show","cn":"戲服","s":"The ________ for the queen took two months to make, because every flower on the dress was sewn by hand.","zh":"女王的戲服花了兩個月才完成,因為裙子上的每一朵花都是手工縫製的。","part":"A","sec":"Performing Arts & Music 表演藝術與音樂","lab":"A200","t":"戲服"},{"w":"admire","pos":"v.","def":"to look at something with pleasure and respect","cn":"欣賞;讚嘆","s":"We stopped to ________ the huge mural for a few minutes, and then we took photos of it for our class project.","zh":"我們停下來欣賞這幅巨大的壁畫幾分鐘,然後為班級報告拍了照片。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B1","t":"欣賞"},{"w":"applaud","pos":"v.","def":"to clap or to praise someone's action","cn":"鼓掌;讚揚","s":"The audience began to ________ before the music finished, so the conductor turned around and smiled.","zh":"音樂還沒結束觀眾就開始鼓掌,所以指揮轉過身來微笑。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B2","t":"鼓掌"},{"w":"astonish","pos":"v.","def":"to surprise someone very much","cn":"使驚訝","s":"The young girl's paintings ________ the judges, because nobody expected such skill from a ten-year-old.","zh":"這位小女孩的畫作讓評審大為驚訝,因為沒人預料到一個十歲孩子有如此技巧。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B3","t":"讓 大為驚訝"},{"w":"captivate","pos":"v.","def":"to hold someone's attention completely","cn":"吸引;迷住","s":"The puppet show managed to ________ the noisy children, and the room became completely quiet within a minute.","zh":"這場木偶戲成功吸引住吵鬧的孩子們,一分鐘內整個房間就變得鴉雀無聲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B4","t":"吸引住"},{"w":"celebrate","pos":"v.","def":"to show that an event or person is important","cn":"頌揚;慶祝","s":"The festival aims to ________ local artists, so all the paintings on show were made by people from the village.","zh":"這個藝術節旨在頌揚在地藝術家,所以所有展出的畫作都是村民創作的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B5","t":"頌揚"},{"w":"cherish","pos":"v.","def":"to love and care for something very much","cn":"珍惜;珍愛","s":"My mother still ________ the clay bowl I made in kindergarten, although it is uneven and slightly broken.","zh":"我媽媽至今仍珍惜我幼稚園時做的陶碗,雖然它歪歪的又有點破損。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B6","t":"珍惜"},{"w":"deconstruct","pos":"v.","def":"to break an idea or object into parts to understand it","cn":"解構","s":"In art history class, we ________ famous paintings by looking at their colours, shapes and hidden symbols one by one.","zh":"在藝術史課上,我們透過逐一觀察顏色、形狀和隱藏的象徵來解構名畫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B7","t":"解構"},{"w":"delight","pos":"v.","def":"to give someone great pleasure","cn":"使高興;使欣喜","s":"The magician's tricks ________ the children at the party, and they begged him to perform again.","zh":"魔術師的把戲讓派對上的孩子們很開心,他們央求他再表演一次。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B8","t":"讓 很開心"},{"w":"disapprove","pos":"v.","def":"to think something is bad or wrong","cn":"不贊成","s":"My parents ________ of my plan to study art, because they think artists cannot earn enough money.","zh":"我爸媽不贊成我念藝術的計畫,因為他們認為藝術家賺不了足夠的錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B9","t":"不贊成"},{"w":"explore","pos":"v.","def":"to examine or try out something in order to learn about it","cn":"探索","s":"In her new paintings she wants to ________ the feeling of loneliness, so many of them show empty streets at night.","zh":"在她的新畫作中,她想探索孤獨的感受,所以許多作品描繪夜晚空蕩的街道。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B10","t":"探索"},{"w":"fascinate","pos":"v.","def":"to interest someone very much","cn":"使著迷","s":"Old maps have always ________ my brother, and he spends hours studying the strange sea monsters drawn on them.","zh":"古地圖一向讓我哥哥著迷,他會花好幾個小時研究上面畫的奇怪海怪。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B11","t":"讓 著迷"},{"w":"idolise","pos":"v.","def":"to admire someone too much","cn":"崇拜;偶像化","s":"Many teenagers ________ pop stars, but they often know little about the hard work behind the shows.","zh":"許多青少年崇拜流行歌星,但他們往往對演出背後的辛苦所知甚少。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B12","t":"崇拜"},{"w":"immerse","pos":"v.","def":"to become completely involved in something","cn":"沉浸","s":"When she paints, she likes to ________ herself in the work, so she turns off her phone for the whole afternoon.","zh":"她畫畫時喜歡讓自己完全沉浸其中,所以她整個下午都會關掉手機。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B13","t":"沉浸"},{"w":"liberate","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone free","cn":"解放","s":"Photography helped ________ painters from simply copying reality, so they began to experiment with colour and shape.","zh":"攝影幫助解放畫家,使他們不必只是複製現實,於是他們開始實驗色彩與形狀。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B14","t":"解放"},{"w":"mesmerise","pos":"v.","def":"to hold someone's attention so they cannot look away","cn":"使入迷","s":"The dancer's slow movements seemed to ________ the crowd, and nobody even took out a phone during the show.","zh":"舞者緩慢的動作似乎讓觀眾入迷,表演期間甚至沒有人拿出手機。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B15","t":"讓 入迷"},{"w":"personify","pos":"v.","def":"to give human qualities to an object or idea","cn":"擬人化","s":"Many fairy tales ________ the wind and the moon, so children imagine that nature can talk and feel.","zh":"許多童話把風和月亮擬人化,所以孩子們想像大自然會說話、有感覺。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B16","t":"擬人化"},{"w":"reinterpret","pos":"v.","def":"to explain or perform something in a new way","cn":"重新詮釋","s":"The young director decided to ________ the old Chinese legend, and she set the story in modern Taipei.","zh":"這位年輕導演決定重新詮釋這個中國古老傳說,並把故事背景設在現代台北。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B17","t":"重新詮釋"},{"w":"reimagine","pos":"v.","def":"to think about something again in a new way","cn":"重新構想","s":"The designers wanted to ________ the old factory as an art centre, so they kept the brick walls but added glass roofs.","zh":"設計師們想把舊工廠重新構想成藝術中心,所以保留了磚牆但加上玻璃屋頂。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B18","t":"重新構想"},{"w":"popularise","pos":"v.","def":"to make something liked by many people","cn":"使普及","s":"Television shows helped ________ cooking as a hobby, and now many young people share their recipes online.","zh":"電視節目幫助普及了烹飪這項嗜好,現在許多年輕人在網路上分享食譜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B19","t":"普及"},{"w":"democratise","pos":"v.","def":"to make something available to everyone","cn":"使大眾化","s":"Smartphones have ________ photography, because almost everyone now carries a good camera in their pocket.","zh":"智慧型手機讓攝影大眾化了,因為現在幾乎人人口袋裡都有一台好相機。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B20","t":"大眾化"},{"w":"innovate","pos":"v.","def":"to introduce new ideas or methods","cn":"創新","s":"Artists who refuse to ________ may lose their audience, because people want to see something fresh.","zh":"拒絕創新的藝術家可能會失去觀眾,因為人們想看到新鮮的東西。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B21","t":"創新"},{"w":"borrow","pos":"v.","def":"to take and use an idea from another person or culture","cn":"借用","s":"Many Western artists ________ ideas from Japanese prints in the 1800s, and you can see this in their bold, flat colours.","zh":"1800年代許多西方藝術家借用了日本版畫的構想,你可以從他們大膽平塗的色彩中看出這點。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B22","t":"借用"},{"w":"crystallise","pos":"v.","def":"to make an idea clear and definite","cn":"使具體化;使明確","s":"Talking with my teacher helped ________ my ideas, so I finally knew what my final project would be about.","zh":"和老師談話幫助我把想法具體化,所以我終於知道期末作品要做什麼了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B23","t":"具體化"},{"w":"typify","pos":"v.","def":"to be a typical example of something","cn":"是…的典型","s":"Bright colours and bold lines ________ his early work, while his later paintings are much darker.","zh":"鮮豔的色彩和大膽的線條是他早期作品的典型特徵,而他晚期的畫作則陰暗許多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B24","t":"典型特徵"},{"w":"dabble","pos":"v.","def":"to try an activity without being serious about it","cn":"涉獵;玩票","s":"My father likes to ________ in painting at weekends, but he says he will never show his work to anyone.","zh":"我爸爸週末喜歡玩票畫畫,但他說他絕不會把作品給任何人看。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B25","t":"玩票"},{"w":"outshine","pos":"v.","def":"to be much better than others","cn":"勝過;比…出色","s":"The young actor managed to ________ the famous stars in the film, so many critics praised his performance.","zh":"這位年輕演員在片中勝過了那些知名明星,所以許多影評人稱讚他的演出。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B26","t":"勝過"},{"w":"redeem","pos":"v.","def":"to make something seem less bad","cn":"彌補;挽回","s":"The film's story is weak, but the beautiful music helps ________ it, so I still enjoyed watching it.","zh":"這部電影的劇情很弱,但優美的配樂幫忙彌補了缺點,所以我還是看得很開心。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B27","t":"彌補"},{"w":"rekindle","pos":"v.","def":"to make a feeling active again","cn":"重新燃起","s":"Visiting the art museum helped ________ my interest in drawing, so I bought a new sketchbook on the way home.","zh":"參觀美術館重新燃起我對畫畫的興趣,所以我在回家路上買了一本新的素描本。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B28","t":"重新燃起"},{"w":"enliven","pos":"v.","def":"to make something more lively and interesting","cn":"使有生氣","s":"Colourful murals ________ the grey walls of the old market, and more young people now visit it at weekends.","zh":"色彩繽紛的壁畫讓老市場灰色的牆面有了生氣,現在週末有更多年輕人來逛。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B29","t":"讓 有了生氣"},{"w":"ridicule","pos":"v.","def":"to laugh at someone in an unkind way","cn":"嘲笑","s":"Critics ________ the Impressionists at first, but today their paintings are among the most expensive in the world.","zh":"評論家起初嘲笑印象派畫家,但如今他們的畫作是世上最昂貴的作品之一。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B30","t":"嘲笑"},{"w":"scorn","pos":"v.","def":"to show that you think something is worthless","cn":"輕蔑;鄙視","s":"Some traditional painters ________ digital art, but young artists believe a tablet is just another kind of brush.","zh":"有些傳統畫家鄙視數位藝術,但年輕藝術家認為平板只是另一種畫筆。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B31","t":"鄙視"},{"w":"mock","pos":"v.","def":"to laugh at someone and make them look silly","cn":"嘲弄","s":"Classmates used to ________ his strange drawings, but now he is a successful illustrator with thousands of fans.","zh":"同學以前常嘲弄他奇怪的畫,但現在他是擁有數千名粉絲的成功插畫家。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B32","t":"嘲弄"},{"w":"satirise","pos":"v.","def":"to use humour to criticise people or ideas","cn":"諷刺","s":"The comedy show likes to ________ politicians, so some leaders have tried to stop it from being broadcast.","zh":"這個喜劇節目喜歡諷刺政治人物,所以有些領導人曾試圖阻止它播出。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B33","t":"諷刺"},{"w":"persevere","pos":"v.","def":"to keep trying although it is difficult","cn":"堅持不懈","s":"Learning the violin was very hard at first, but she decided to ________, and now she plays in a famous orchestra.","zh":"學小提琴一開始非常困難,但她決定堅持不懈,現在她在一個知名管弦樂團演奏。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B34","t":"堅持不懈"},{"w":"recreate","pos":"v.","def":"to make something exist again or copy it","cn":"重現","s":"The students tried to ________ the famous painting using only coloured rice, and the result looked surprisingly good.","zh":"學生們試著只用彩色米粒重現那幅名畫,結果看起來出奇地好。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B35","t":"重現"},{"w":"unsettle","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone feel worried or uncomfortable","cn":"使不安","s":"The dark film is designed to ________ viewers, so the music becomes louder whenever the camera moves slowly.","zh":"這部黑暗電影的設計就是要讓觀眾不安,所以每當鏡頭緩慢移動時音樂就會變大聲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B36","t":"讓 不安"},{"w":"intrigue","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone very interested and curious","cn":"引起好奇","s":"The strange title of the exhibition ________ me, so I went inside although I had planned to go shopping.","zh":"展覽奇特的名稱引起我的好奇,所以雖然我原本打算去逛街,還是走了進去。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B37","t":"引起 好奇"},{"w":"enchant","pos":"v.","def":"to charm and delight someone","cn":"使陶醉;迷住","s":"The old fairy-tale illustrations ________ readers of every age, and the book has been printed again and again.","zh":"這些古老的童話插畫迷住了各個年齡層的讀者,這本書也一再重印。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B38","t":"迷住"},{"w":"dazzle","pos":"v.","def":"to impress someone greatly with skill or beauty","cn":"使驚豔;使目眩","s":"The fireworks show ________ the crowd by the river, and everyone looked up at the sky with their mouths open.","zh":"煙火秀讓河邊的人群驚豔不已,每個人都張大嘴巴仰望天空。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B39","t":"讓 驚豔不已"},{"w":"transfix","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone unable to move because of shock or interest","cn":"使呆住","s":"The huge whale sculpture seemed to ________ the children, and they stood under it without saying a word.","zh":"那座巨大的鯨魚雕塑似乎讓孩子們看呆了,他們一語不發地站在它下面。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B40","t":"讓 看呆了"},{"w":"underfund","pos":"v.","def":"to give too little money to something","cn":"資金不足","s":"The government continues to ________ the arts, so many small theatres have closed in recent years.","zh":"政府持續對藝術投入不足的資金,所以近年來許多小劇場都關門了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B41","t":"對 投入不足的資金"},{"w":"encourage","pos":"v.","def":"to give someone confidence or support to do something","cn":"鼓勵","s":"Good teachers ________ students to try new materials, and they do not punish them for messy experiments.","zh":"好老師會鼓勵學生嘗試新素材,而且不會因為實驗弄得亂七八糟而處罰他們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B42","t":"鼓勵"},{"w":"unlock","pos":"v.","def":"to release or make something available","cn":"釋放;開啟","s":"Music can ________ old memories in people with poor memory, so some care homes play songs from the 1960s.","zh":"音樂能為記憶力不好的人開啟舊回憶,所以有些安養院會播放1960年代的歌曲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B43","t":"開啟"},{"w":"polish","pos":"v.","def":"to improve something by making small changes","cn":"潤飾;改進","s":"The singer spent a week trying to ________ her performance, but she still felt nervous before the competition.","zh":"這位歌手花了一週試圖潤飾她的演出,但比賽前她仍然感到緊張。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B44","t":"潤飾"},{"w":"abstraction","pos":"n.","def":"art that does not show real objects","cn":"抽象","s":"Her early paintings show real people, but later she moved towards pure ________, using only lines and colour.","zh":"她早期的畫作描繪真實人物,但後來轉向純粹的抽象,只使用線條和色彩。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B45","t":"抽象"},{"w":"admiration","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling of great respect and approval","cn":"欽佩;讚賞","s":"I have great ________ for street artists, because they work in the heat and rain but rarely receive any credit.","zh":"我非常欽佩街頭藝術家,因為他們在炎熱和雨中工作,卻很少得到認可。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B46","t":"欽佩"},{"w":"awe","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling of great respect mixed with wonder","cn":"敬畏;驚嘆","s":"We stood in ________ in front of the giant Buddha statue, because it was much larger than we had imagined.","zh":"我們滿懷敬畏地站在巨大的佛像前,因為它比我們想像的大得多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B47","t":"敬畏"},{"w":"canon","pos":"n.","def":"the group of works seen as the most important","cn":"經典作品;正典","s":"Women artists were often left out of the art ________, so museums are now trying to show more of their work.","zh":"女性藝術家常被排除在藝術經典作品之外,所以博物館現在正努力展出更多她們的作品。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B48","t":"經典作品"},{"w":"contemplation","pos":"n.","def":"quiet, careful thinking about something","cn":"沉思","s":"The quiet garden was designed for ________, so visitors are asked to turn off their phones and speak softly.","zh":"這座寧靜的庭園是為沉思而設計的,所以遊客被要求關掉手機並輕聲說話。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B49","t":"沉思"},{"w":"craftsmanship","pos":"n.","def":"skill in making things by hand","cn":"工藝技術;手藝","s":"The ________ of this wooden temple door is amazing, because no nails were used to hold it together.","zh":"這扇木製廟門的工藝技術令人驚嘆,因為完全沒有使用釘子來固定。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B50","t":"工藝技術"},{"w":"discernment","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to judge what is good","cn":"鑑賞力;辨別力","s":"Collectors need ________ to choose valuable paintings, because many attractive works lose their value over time.","zh":"收藏家需要鑑賞力來挑選有價值的畫作,因為許多吸引人的作品會隨時間貶值。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B51","t":"鑑賞力"},{"w":"elegance","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of being graceful and stylish","cn":"優雅","s":"The dancer moved with great ________, so the audience hardly noticed how difficult the steps were.","zh":"這位舞者的動作極為優雅,所以觀眾幾乎沒察覺舞步有多困難。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B52","t":"優雅"},{"w":"embellishment","pos":"n.","def":"a decoration added to make something more attractive","cn":"裝飾;潤色","s":"The old palace door has gold ________ on every corner, but the simple wooden centre is actually the oldest part.","zh":"這扇古老宮殿大門的每個角落都有金色裝飾,但樸素的木製中央部分其實是最古老的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B53","t":"裝飾"},{"w":"enthusiast","pos":"n.","def":"a person who is very interested in an activity","cn":"愛好者;熱衷者","s":"My uncle is a jazz ________, and he has collected more than two thousand old records since he was a teenager.","zh":"我叔叔是爵士樂愛好者,他從青少年時期就收集了兩千多張老唱片。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B54","t":"愛好者"},{"w":"esteem","pos":"n.","def":"respect and admiration","cn":"尊敬;敬重","s":"The old calligrapher is held in high ________ in his town, so people ask him to write couplets for every festival.","zh":"這位老書法家在鎮上備受敬重,所以每逢節慶大家都請他寫春聯。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B55","t":"敬重"},{"w":"expression","pos":"n.","def":"showing feelings or ideas through words or art","cn":"表達","s":"Poetry was her main form of ________, because she found it difficult to talk about her feelings with others.","zh":"詩是她主要的表達方式,因為她發現很難和別人談論自己的感受。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B56","t":"表達"},{"w":"fascination","pos":"n.","def":"a very strong interest","cn":"著迷","s":"His ________ with insects began in childhood, and later he became famous for his detailed drawings of butterflies.","zh":"他對昆蟲的著迷從童年就開始了,後來他以精細的蝴蝶素描而聞名。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B57","t":"著迷"},{"w":"iconography","pos":"n.","def":"the symbols used in a type of art and their meanings","cn":"圖像學;象徵圖像","s":"Temple ________ is full of meaning, because each animal and colour on the roof represents a different blessing.","zh":"廟宇的象徵圖像充滿意義,因為屋頂上的每種動物和顏色都代表不同的祝福。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B58","t":"象徵圖像"},{"w":"ideal","pos":"n.","def":"a perfect idea or standard you want to reach","cn":"理想","s":"Ancient Greek statues show an ________ of beauty, but real people rarely looked so perfect.","zh":"古希臘雕像展現了一種美的理想,但真實的人很少看起來那麼完美。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B59","t":"理想"},{"w":"imagery","pos":"n.","def":"pictures or descriptions that create images in the mind","cn":"意象","s":"The poem uses rich ________ of the sea, so readers can almost hear the waves when they read it aloud.","zh":"這首詩運用了豐富的海洋意象,所以讀者朗讀時幾乎能聽見浪聲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B60","t":"意象"},{"w":"impression","pos":"n.","def":"the feeling or idea you get from something","cn":"印象","s":"My first ________ of the gallery was not good, but the guide's stories changed my mind completely.","zh":"我對這家畫廊的第一印象不太好,但導覽員的故事完全改變了我的想法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B61","t":"印象"},{"w":"intellect","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to think and understand ideas","cn":"智力;才智","s":"His paintings appeal to the ________ more than the heart, so some viewers find them clever but cold.","zh":"他的畫作訴諸理智多於情感,所以有些觀眾覺得它們聰明卻冷漠。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B62","t":"理智"},{"w":"juxtaposition","pos":"n.","def":"placing two different things side by side","cn":"並置;對比","s":"The ________ of old temples and glass towers makes the city photos interesting, because it shows the past and future together.","zh":"古廟與玻璃高樓的並置讓這些城市照片很有趣,因為它同時呈現過去與未來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B63","t":"並置"},{"w":"magnificence","pos":"n.","def":"great beauty and impressive size","cn":"壯麗;宏偉","s":"Photos cannot show the ________ of the cathedral ceiling, so you really need to see it with your own eyes.","zh":"照片無法呈現大教堂天花板的壯麗,所以你真的需要親眼去看看。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B64","t":"壯麗"},{"w":"obscurity","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being unknown","cn":"默默無聞","s":"The painter lived in ________ for most of his life, and only a few friends bought his paintings.","zh":"這位畫家大半生都默默無聞,只有幾位朋友買過他的畫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B65","t":"默默無聞"},{"w":"patronage","pos":"n.","def":"money and support given to artists by a rich person","cn":"贊助","s":"Thanks to the ________ of wealthy families, many Renaissance artists could work without worrying about food and rent.","zh":"由於富裕家族的贊助,許多文藝復興時期的藝術家能夠工作而不必擔心吃住問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B66","t":"贊助"},{"w":"portrayal","pos":"n.","def":"the way someone or something is shown in art","cn":"描繪;刻畫","s":"The film's ________ of a teenage girl feels very real, because the director interviewed hundreds of students.","zh":"這部電影對少女的刻畫感覺非常真實,因為導演訪問了數百名學生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B67","t":"刻畫"},{"w":"prestige","pos":"n.","def":"respect that comes from success or importance","cn":"聲望","s":"Winning the award brought great ________ to the small design company, and big clients soon began to call.","zh":"贏得這個獎為這家小設計公司帶來極高的聲望,大客戶很快就開始打電話來了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B68","t":"聲望"},{"w":"rendition","pos":"n.","def":"a performance of a song or piece of music","cn":"演繹;演唱","s":"Her ________ of the old folk song was so beautiful that my grandmother started to sing along quietly.","zh":"她對那首老民謠的演繹美極了,我奶奶也開始輕聲跟著唱。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B69","t":"演繹"},{"w":"renown","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being famous","cn":"名聲;聲望","s":"The ceramic artist gained international ________ after her work appeared in a London museum, and her prices rose sharply.","zh":"這位陶藝家的作品在倫敦一家博物館展出後,她獲得了國際聲望,作品價格也大幅上漲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B70","t":"聲望"},{"w":"reproduction","pos":"n.","def":"a copy of a work of art","cn":"複製品","s":"The painting in our classroom is only a cheap ________, but it still helps us learn about the original.","zh":"我們教室裡的畫只是一幅便宜的複製品,但它仍幫助我們認識原作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B71","t":"複製品"},{"w":"resonance","pos":"n.","def":"a special meaning or importance for someone","cn":"共鳴","s":"The song has special ________ for older Taiwanese listeners, because it reminds them of their hometowns.","zh":"這首歌對年長的台灣聽眾有特別的共鳴,因為它讓他們想起家鄉。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B72","t":"共鳴"},{"w":"revival","pos":"n.","def":"a time when something becomes popular again","cn":"復興;重新流行","s":"There has been a ________ of interest in film cameras, and many teenagers now use them to take holiday photos.","zh":"人們對底片相機的興趣重新流行起來,現在許多青少年用它們拍度假照片。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B73","t":"重新流行"},{"w":"sensibility","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to understand and enjoy art or feelings","cn":"感受力;藝術感","s":"The young poet shows a rare ________ to nature, and her short poems about rain are loved by many readers.","zh":"這位年輕詩人展現了對自然罕見的感受力,她寫雨的短詩深受許多讀者喜愛。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B74","t":"感受力"},{"w":"sincerity","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of being honest and true in feelings","cn":"真誠","s":"The audience could feel the ________ in his songs, because he wrote them about his own difficult childhood.","zh":"觀眾能感受到他歌曲中的真誠,因為他寫的是自己艱辛的童年。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B75","t":"真誠"},{"w":"sophistication","pos":"n.","def":"a high level of skill and complexity","cn":"精緻;成熟老練","s":"The ________ of the young designer's work surprised everyone, because she had never studied at an art school.","zh":"這位年輕設計師作品的成熟老練讓所有人驚訝,因為她從未在藝術學校念過書。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B76","t":"成熟老練"},{"w":"symbolism","pos":"n.","def":"the use of objects or colours to represent ideas","cn":"象徵手法","s":"The painting is full of ________, and the broken clock in the corner represents the end of the artist's youth.","zh":"這幅畫充滿象徵手法,角落那座壞掉的時鐘代表藝術家青春的結束。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B77","t":"象徵手法"},{"w":"vibrancy","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of being bright, lively and exciting","cn":"活力;鮮明","s":"The ________ of the night market inspired her photos, because she loved the colours, noise and steam everywhere.","zh":"夜市的活力啟發了她的攝影作品,因為她熱愛那裡無處不在的色彩、喧鬧與蒸氣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B78","t":"活力"},{"w":"virtuosity","pos":"n.","def":"very great skill in music or art","cn":"精湛技藝","s":"The violinist played with such ________ that the audience stood up and cheered before the last note ended.","zh":"這位小提琴家的演奏技藝如此精湛,觀眾在最後一個音結束前就起立歡呼。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B79","t":"精湛"},{"w":"audacity","pos":"n.","def":"brave or rude confidence to do something shocking","cn":"膽量;大膽","s":"Critics were shocked by the ________ of the young artist, because she hung an ordinary bicycle in the national gallery.","zh":"評論家對這位年輕藝術家的大膽感到震驚,因為她把一輛普通的腳踏車掛在國家美術館裡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B80","t":"大膽"},{"w":"excellence","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of being extremely good","cn":"卓越","s":"The award recognises ________ in film-making, and this year it went to a documentary about mountain villages.","zh":"這個獎項表彰電影製作的卓越成就,今年頒給了一部關於山村的紀錄片。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B81","t":"卓越"},{"w":"finesse","pos":"n.","def":"great skill and delicate care","cn":"精巧;手法細膩","s":"The chef decorates every cake with ________, so each one looks like a small work of art.","zh":"這位甜點師以細膩的手法裝飾每個蛋糕,所以每個都像一件小小的藝術品。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B82","t":"細膩的手法"},{"w":"flamboyance","pos":"n.","def":"a very confident, colourful and showy style","cn":"浮誇;張揚","s":"The singer is famous for his ________, and he often appears on stage in gold suits and huge feathered hats.","zh":"這位歌手以張揚聞名,他常穿著金色西裝、戴著巨大的羽毛帽登台。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B83","t":"張揚"},{"w":"grace","pos":"n.","def":"a smooth and attractive way of moving","cn":"優美;優雅","s":"The ballerina crossed the stage with great ________, and she seemed to float above the floor like a feather.","zh":"這位芭蕾舞者以極為優美的姿態穿越舞台,彷彿羽毛般飄浮在地板上方。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B84","t":"優美"},{"w":"humility","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of not thinking you are better than others","cn":"謙遜","s":"Despite his fame, the old master spoke with great ________, and he thanked his students for teaching him new ideas.","zh":"儘管名聞遐邇,這位老大師說話時非常謙遜,還感謝學生教了他新想法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B85","t":"謙遜"},{"w":"irony","pos":"n.","def":"a situation that is the opposite of what you expect","cn":"諷刺","s":"The ________ is that the painter died poor, while his paintings now sell for millions of dollars.","zh":"諷刺的是,這位畫家死時一貧如洗,而他的畫作如今卻以數百萬美元售出。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B86","t":"諷刺"},{"w":"legitimacy","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being accepted as real or fair","cn":"正當性;合法地位","s":"Street art has gained more ________ in recent years, and some cities now invite artists to paint public walls.","zh":"近年來街頭藝術獲得更多正當性,有些城市現在還邀請藝術家彩繪公共牆面。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B87","t":"正當性"},{"w":"mastery","pos":"n.","def":"great skill or knowledge of something","cn":"精通;熟練掌握","s":"His ________ of light and shadow makes his paintings look almost real, and visitors often try to touch them.","zh":"他對光影的精通讓他的畫看起來幾乎是真的,參觀者常想伸手去摸。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B88","t":"精通"},{"w":"mediocrity","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of being only average and not very good","cn":"平庸","s":"The director refused to accept ________, so the actors had to repeat each scene until it was perfect.","zh":"導演拒絕接受平庸,所以演員們必須重複每一場戲直到完美為止。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B89","t":"平庸"},{"w":"melancholy","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling of quiet sadness","cn":"憂鬱;惆悵","s":"There is a deep ________ in his paintings of empty beaches, because he painted them after his wife passed away.","zh":"他筆下空曠海灘的畫作中有一種深沉的憂鬱,因為那是他在妻子過世後畫的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B90","t":"憂鬱"},{"w":"objectivity","pos":"n.","def":"judging fairly without personal feelings","cn":"客觀性","s":"It is hard to judge art with complete ________, because each person brings different feelings and memories to a painting.","zh":"要完全客觀地評判藝術很難,因為每個人面對畫作時都帶著不同的感受和記憶。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B91","t":"客觀"},{"w":"pastiche","pos":"n.","def":"a work that copies the style of other artists","cn":"仿作;拼湊模仿之作","s":"The film is a ________ of old Hollywood musicals, so fans of classic movies will recognise many of the scenes.","zh":"這部電影是老好萊塢歌舞片的仿作,所以經典電影迷會認出許多場景。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B92","t":"仿作"},{"w":"pluralism","pos":"n.","def":"the acceptance of many different styles or beliefs","cn":"多元並存","s":"Today's art world is marked by ________, because no single style is more important than the others.","zh":"當今藝術界的特色是多元並存,因為沒有任何單一風格比其他風格更重要。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B93","t":"多元並存"},{"w":"poise","pos":"n.","def":"a calm, confident way of behaving","cn":"沉著;泰然自若","s":"Although she was only twelve, the pianist played with great ________, and she did not seem nervous at all.","zh":"雖然這位鋼琴家只有十二歲,她演奏時卻非常沉著,一點也不顯得緊張。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B94","t":"沉著"},{"w":"reinvention","pos":"n.","def":"changing yourself or something completely","cn":"重新塑造;改頭換面","s":"The singer is famous for constant ________, and every new album comes with a different look and sound.","zh":"這位歌手以不斷改頭換面聞名,每張新專輯都有不同的造型和曲風。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B95","t":"改頭換面"},{"w":"reverence","pos":"n.","def":"deep respect","cn":"崇敬","s":"Visitors speak with ________ inside the old temple, and they bow before the carved statues of the gods.","zh":"參觀者在古廟內帶著崇敬輕聲說話,並在神明雕像前鞠躬。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B96","t":"崇敬"},{"w":"solitude","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being alone, often happily","cn":"獨處;孤獨","s":"Many writers need ________ to work, so they rent quiet rooms in the mountains far from their families.","zh":"許多作家需要獨處才能工作,所以他們會在遠離家人的山上租安靜的房間。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B97","t":"獨處"},{"w":"transcendence","pos":"n.","def":"going beyond ordinary experience","cn":"超越;超凡","s":"Some people feel a sense of ________ when they listen to great music, as if their worries suddenly disappear.","zh":"有些人聆聽偉大的音樂時會感到一種超凡的感受,彷彿煩惱突然消失了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B98","t":"超凡"},{"w":"triumph","pos":"n.","def":"a great success","cn":"巨大成功;勝利","s":"The opening night was a ________, and the young director received flowers from the whole cast after the show.","zh":"首演之夜大獲成功,演出後年輕導演收到全體演員送的花。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B99","t":"成功"},{"w":"uniqueness","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of being the only one of its kind","cn":"獨特性","s":"The ________ of each handmade cup makes it special, because no two cups have exactly the same shape.","zh":"每個手工杯子的獨特性使它與眾不同,因為沒有兩個杯子的形狀完全相同。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B100","t":"獨特性"},{"w":"versatility","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to do many different things well","cn":"多才多藝;多樣性","s":"The actor is famous for his ________, and he can play a funny teacher one year and a cruel king the next.","zh":"這位演員以多才多藝聞名,他今年能演搞笑老師,明年又能演殘暴的國王。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B101","t":"多才多藝"},{"w":"whimsy","pos":"n.","def":"playful, unusual humour","cn":"奇想;異想天開","s":"The children's book is full of ________, so cats ride bicycles and teapots dance on the kitchen table.","zh":"這本童書充滿奇想,所以貓會騎腳踏車,茶壺會在廚房餐桌上跳舞。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B102","t":"奇想"},{"w":"wit","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to say clever and funny things","cn":"機智;風趣","s":"The writer's ________ made the serious topic easy to read, and readers laughed while they learned about history.","zh":"作者的風趣讓嚴肅的主題變得好讀,讀者一邊學歷史一邊大笑。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B103","t":"風趣"},{"w":"zest","pos":"n.","def":"great energy and enthusiasm","cn":"熱情;興致","s":"At eighty, the painter still works with great ________, and she gets up at five every morning to paint.","zh":"八十歲的這位畫家仍然充滿熱情地工作,她每天早上五點起床畫畫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B104","t":"熱情"},{"w":"elitism","pos":"n.","def":"the belief that only a small group deserves the best things","cn":"菁英主義","s":"Some people accuse classical music of ________, because concert tickets are expensive and the dress code feels strict.","zh":"有些人指責古典音樂有菁英主義之嫌,因為音樂會票價昂貴,服裝規定也讓人覺得嚴格。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B105","t":"菁英主義"},{"w":"exclusivity","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of being available only to a few people","cn":"獨佔性;排他性","s":"The gallery sells limited prints to create a sense of ________, so collectors feel lucky when they get one.","zh":"這家畫廊販售限量版畫來營造獨佔性,所以收藏家買到時會覺得很幸運。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B106","t":"獨佔性"},{"w":"provocation","pos":"n.","def":"an action that makes people angry or react","cn":"挑釁","s":"The artist's broken toilet was a deliberate ________, because he wanted people to argue about what art means.","zh":"這位藝術家的破馬桶作品是刻意的挑釁,因為他想讓人們爭論藝術的意義。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B107","t":"挑釁"},{"w":"appropriation","pos":"n.","def":"taking something from another person or culture and using it","cn":"挪用","s":"Some fashion designers have been criticised for ________ of traditional patterns, because they did not ask local communities first.","zh":"有些時裝設計師因挪用傳統圖騰而受到批評,因為他們事先沒有徵詢當地社群。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B108","t":"挪用"},{"w":"inclusivity","pos":"n.","def":"including all kinds of people","cn":"包容性","s":"The museum is working on ________, so it now offers sign language tours and touchable sculptures for blind visitors.","zh":"這間博物館正致力於包容性,所以現在提供手語導覽和可供視障者觸摸的雕塑。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B109","t":"包容性"},{"w":"funding","pos":"n.","def":"money given for a particular purpose","cn":"資金;經費","s":"The theatre lost its government ________ last year, so it had to ask local businesses for help.","zh":"這家劇院去年失去了政府經費,所以必須向在地企業求助。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B110","t":"經費"},{"w":"philanthropy","pos":"n.","def":"giving money to help others","cn":"慈善事業","s":"Her ________ has helped many young musicians, because she pays for their lessons and buys them good instruments.","zh":"她的慈善事業幫助了許多年輕音樂家,因為她為他們支付課程費用並買好樂器給他們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B111","t":"慈善事業"},{"w":"luminary","pos":"n.","def":"a famous and respected person in a field","cn":"傑出人物;泰斗","s":"The festival invited several ________ of world cinema, and students queued for hours to hear them speak.","zh":"影展邀請了數位世界電影界的泰斗,學生們排隊好幾個小時聽他們演講。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B112","t":"泰斗"},{"w":"devotee","pos":"n.","def":"a person who loves an activity very much","cn":"愛好者;熱衷者","s":"As a ________ of Taiwanese puppet theatre, my uncle watches every performance at the temple festival.","zh":"身為台灣布袋戲的熱衷者,我叔叔看遍廟會上的每一場演出。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B113","t":"熱衷者"},{"w":"aficionado","pos":"n.","def":"a person who knows and loves a subject well","cn":"行家;狂熱愛好者","s":"Every film ________ in the city came to see the old movie, because it had not been shown for forty years.","zh":"城裡每位電影行家都來看這部老電影,因為它已經四十年沒有放映了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B114","t":"行家"},{"w":"maestro","pos":"n.","def":"a great musician or conductor","cn":"大師;名指揮","s":"The old ________ conducted the orchestra without any notes, and the young musicians followed every movement of his hands.","zh":"這位老大師不看樂譜指揮管弦樂團,年輕樂手們緊隨他手上的每一個動作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B115","t":"大師"},{"w":"acclaimed","pos":"adj.","def":"praised by many people","cn":"廣受讚譽的","s":"The ________ director spoke to our class about her films, and she told us to watch people carefully on buses.","zh":"這位廣受讚譽的導演到我們班上談她的電影,她告訴我們要在公車上仔細觀察人們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B116","t":"廣受讚譽的"},{"w":"accomplished","pos":"adj.","def":"very skilled at something","cn":"技藝精湛的;有造詣的","s":"My piano teacher is an ________ musician, but she is very patient with beginners like me.","zh":"我的鋼琴老師是一位技藝精湛的音樂家,但她對像我這樣的初學者非常有耐心。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B117","t":"技藝精湛的"},{"w":"appealing","pos":"adj.","def":"attractive or interesting","cn":"吸引人的","s":"The bright cover makes the book ________ to children, so it sells well in bookshops near primary schools.","zh":"鮮豔的封面讓這本書對孩子很吸引人,所以它在國小附近的書店賣得很好。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B118","t":"吸引人"},{"w":"awe-inspiring","pos":"adj.","def":"making you feel great respect and wonder","cn":"令人敬畏的;令人驚嘆的","s":"The view from the top of the mountain was ________, and several of us were too surprised to say anything.","zh":"山頂的景色令人驚嘆,我們好幾個人驚訝得說不出話。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B119","t":"令人驚嘆"},{"w":"bold","pos":"adj.","def":"strong and clear, or brave","cn":"大膽的;醒目的","s":"The poster uses ________ red letters, so people can read it easily from the other side of the street.","zh":"這張海報使用醒目的紅色字體,所以人們從對街就能輕鬆看清。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B120","t":"醒目的"},{"w":"breathtaking","pos":"adj.","def":"extremely beautiful or surprising","cn":"令人屏息的","s":"The dancers' final jump was ________, and the whole theatre was silent for a second before everyone cheered.","zh":"舞者最後一躍令人屏息,整座劇院安靜了一秒,接著所有人歡呼起來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B121","t":"令人屏息"},{"w":"budding","pos":"adj.","def":"starting to develop and showing promise","cn":"嶄露頭角的;初露鋒芒的","s":"The summer camp is designed for ________ artists, so most of the students are teenagers who have just begun painting.","zh":"這個夏令營是為嶄露頭角的藝術家設計的,所以大多數學員是剛開始畫畫的青少年。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B122","t":"嶄露頭角的"},{"w":"daring","pos":"adj.","def":"brave and willing to take risks","cn":"大膽的;勇於冒險的","s":"Her ________ designs shocked the fashion world, but young people loved the unusual colours and shapes.","zh":"她大膽的設計震驚時尚界,但年輕人很喜歡那些不尋常的色彩和造型。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B123","t":"大膽的"},{"w":"decorative","pos":"adj.","def":"made to look pretty","cn":"裝飾性的","s":"The plates are purely ________, so please do not put food on them or wash them in the dishwasher.","zh":"這些盤子純屬裝飾性的,所以請不要在上面放食物或放進洗碗機清洗。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B124","t":"裝飾性的"},{"w":"enigmatic","pos":"adj.","def":"mysterious and hard to understand","cn":"神秘的;令人費解的","s":"The woman in the painting has an ________ smile, and visitors still argue about whether she is happy or sad.","zh":"畫中女子帶著神秘的微笑,參觀者至今仍爭論她是開心還是難過。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B125","t":"神秘的"},{"w":"evocative","pos":"adj.","def":"bringing strong memories or feelings to mind","cn":"引起回憶的;喚起情感的","s":"The smell of the old bookshop was very ________, and it reminded me of reading with my father as a child.","zh":"舊書店的氣味非常喚起回憶,讓我想起小時候和爸爸一起閱讀的時光。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B126","t":"喚起回憶"},{"w":"flawless","pos":"adj.","def":"perfect, with no mistakes","cn":"完美無瑕的","s":"The pianist gave a ________ performance, but she said afterwards that her hands were shaking the whole time.","zh":"這位鋼琴家的演出完美無瑕,但她事後說她的手一直在發抖。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B127","t":"完美無瑕"},{"w":"iconic","pos":"adj.","def":"very famous and seen as a symbol","cn":"具代表性的;標誌性的","s":"Taipei 101 is an ________ building, so it appears on many postcards, posters and souvenirs.","zh":"台北101是一棟具代表性的建築,所以它出現在許多明信片、海報和紀念品上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B128","t":"具代表性的"},{"w":"immortal","pos":"adj.","def":"remembered for ever","cn":"不朽的","s":"Shakespeare's plays seem ________, because people around the world still perform them four hundred years later.","zh":"莎士比亞的戲劇似乎是不朽的,因為四百年後世界各地的人們仍在演出。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B129","t":"不朽的"},{"w":"inspirational","pos":"adj.","def":"making people want to do something good","cn":"激勵人心的","s":"The blind painter gave an ________ talk at our school, and many students decided to try new hobbies afterwards.","zh":"這位盲人畫家在我們學校發表了一場激勵人心的演講,之後許多學生決定嘗試新嗜好。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B130","t":"激勵人心的"},{"w":"legendary","pos":"adj.","def":"very famous and admired for a long time","cn":"傳奇的","s":"The ________ guitarist played a free concert in the park, and fans travelled from other cities to see him.","zh":"這位傳奇吉他手在公園舉辦免費音樂會,歌迷從其他城市遠道而來看他。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B131","t":"傳奇"},{"w":"literary","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to books, poems and writing","cn":"文學的","s":"She won a ________ prize for her first novel, and the book was soon translated into twelve languages.","zh":"她以第一本小說贏得文學獎,這本書很快就被翻譯成十二種語言。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B132","t":"文學"},{"w":"majestic","pos":"adj.","def":"very beautiful, large and impressive","cn":"雄偉的;莊嚴的","s":"The ________ mountains in the painting look calm and strong, while the tiny boat below seems lost.","zh":"畫中雄偉的山脈看起來沉靜而堅毅,而下方的小船則顯得迷茫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B133","t":"雄偉的"},{"w":"meaningful","pos":"adj.","def":"important and having a clear purpose","cn":"有意義的","s":"Making art with elderly people was a ________ experience, because they shared stories about their lives as they painted.","zh":"和長者一起創作藝術是一次有意義的經驗,因為他們邊畫邊分享自己的人生故事。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B134","t":"有意義的"},{"w":"memorable","pos":"adj.","def":"worth remembering","cn":"難忘的","s":"The concert on the beach was truly ________, because the sun set behind the stage during the last song.","zh":"海灘上的音樂會真的令人難忘,因為最後一首歌時太陽在舞台後方落下。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B135","t":"令人難忘"},{"w":"moving","pos":"adj.","def":"making you feel strong emotions, especially sadness","cn":"感人的","s":"The film about the old dog was so ________ that I cried, and my friend had to give me a tissue.","zh":"那部關於老狗的電影太感人了,我哭了,朋友只好遞給我一張面紙。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B136","t":"感人"},{"w":"nostalgic","pos":"adj.","def":"feeling happy and sad about the past","cn":"懷舊的","s":"Old cartoon songs make my parents feel ________, so they sing along whenever they hear them on the radio.","zh":"老卡通歌曲讓我爸媽感到懷舊,所以每當在收音機聽到時他們都會跟著唱。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B137","t":"懷舊"},{"w":"nuanced","pos":"adj.","def":"showing small but important differences","cn":"細膩的;有層次的","s":"The actor gave a ________ performance, so the villain seemed both cruel and lonely at the same time.","zh":"這位演員的演出非常細膩,所以反派角色同時顯得既殘忍又孤獨。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B138","t":"細膩"},{"w":"ornamental","pos":"adj.","def":"used for decoration rather than use","cn":"裝飾用的","s":"The garden has many ________ stones, but the children use them as chairs during the summer festival.","zh":"花園裡有許多裝飾用的石頭,但夏日節慶時孩子們把它們當椅子坐。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B139","t":"裝飾用的"},{"w":"poetic","pos":"adj.","def":"beautiful and full of feeling, like poetry","cn":"詩意的","s":"The film has a ________ ending, and the last scene shows two old friends watching the rain in silence.","zh":"這部電影有個富有詩意的結局,最後一幕是兩位老朋友默默看著雨。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B140","t":"富有詩意的"},{"w":"radiant","pos":"adj.","def":"bright and shining","cn":"燦爛的;容光煥發的","s":"The bride looked ________ in her red dress, and the photographer said it was the easiest wedding he had ever photographed.","zh":"新娘穿著紅色禮服容光煥發,攝影師說這是他拍過最輕鬆的婚禮。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B141","t":"容光煥發"},{"w":"refined","pos":"adj.","def":"elegant and showing good taste","cn":"精緻的;高雅的","s":"The tea house has a ________ atmosphere, so customers speak quietly while they enjoy their tea.","zh":"這間茶館有著高雅的氛圍,所以顧客品茶時都輕聲細語。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B142","t":"高雅的"},{"w":"representational","pos":"adj.","def":"showing things as they look in real life","cn":"具象的","s":"Children usually start with ________ drawings of houses and people, but later some of them try abstract shapes.","zh":"孩子們通常從房子和人物的具象畫開始,但後來有些人會嘗試抽象形狀。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B143","t":"具象"},{"w":"restrained","pos":"adj.","def":"calm and controlled, not too strong","cn":"克制的;含蓄的","s":"The actor gave a ________ performance, but his quiet sadness touched the audience more than loud crying could.","zh":"這位演員的演出很克制,但他安靜的哀傷比大聲哭泣更打動觀眾。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B144","t":"克制"},{"w":"rhythmic","pos":"adj.","def":"having a regular repeated pattern of sounds","cn":"有節奏的","s":"The ________ sound of the drums filled the street, and soon people began to dance in front of the temple.","zh":"有節奏的鼓聲充滿了街道,很快人們就開始在廟前跳起舞來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B145","t":"有節奏的"},{"w":"sentimental","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with feelings and memories, not value","cn":"有情感價值的;多愁善感的","s":"The old guitar has ________ value for my father, because his best friend gave it to him before moving abroad.","zh":"這把舊吉他對我爸爸有情感上的價值,因為那是他最好的朋友出國前送他的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B146","t":"情感上的"},{"w":"skilful","pos":"adj.","def":"very good at doing something","cn":"熟練的;技巧高超的","s":"The ________ potter made ten cups in an hour, and every one of them was the same size and shape.","zh":"這位技巧高超的陶藝家一小時做了十個杯子,而且每一個的大小和形狀都一樣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B147","t":"技巧高超的"},{"w":"stunning","pos":"adj.","def":"extremely beautiful or impressive","cn":"極美的;令人驚豔的","s":"The photos of the sunrise were ________, so the magazine used one of them for its front cover.","zh":"那些日出照片令人驚豔,所以雜誌用了其中一張當封面。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B148","t":"令人驚豔"},{"w":"subdued","pos":"adj.","def":"soft and not bright","cn":"柔和的;低調的","s":"The café uses ________ lighting in the evening, so customers feel relaxed and stay longer.","zh":"這家咖啡廳晚上使用柔和的燈光,所以顧客感到放鬆並待得更久。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B149","t":"柔和的"},{"w":"superb","pos":"adj.","def":"extremely good","cn":"極好的;一流的","s":"The actors were ________ in the new play, but the story was too long and some people fell asleep.","zh":"演員們在新戲中的表現一流,但故事太長,有些人睡著了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B150","t":"一流"},{"w":"thought-provoking","pos":"adj.","def":"making people think seriously","cn":"發人深省的","s":"The documentary was ________, and after watching it our class discussed plastic waste for the whole lesson.","zh":"這部紀錄片發人深省,看完後我們班整堂課都在討論塑膠垃圾。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B151","t":"發人深省"},{"w":"understated","pos":"adj.","def":"simple and not trying to attract attention","cn":"低調的;含蓄的","s":"Her clothes are always ________, but people notice her because her colours are chosen so carefully.","zh":"她的衣著總是很低調,但人們會注意到她,因為她的配色選得非常用心。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B152","t":"低調"},{"w":"unorthodox","pos":"adj.","def":"different from what is usual or accepted","cn":"非正統的;另類的","s":"The teacher uses ________ methods, such as painting with toothbrushes, but her students win many prizes.","zh":"這位老師使用另類的方法,例如用牙刷畫畫,但她的學生贏得許多獎項。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B153","t":"另類的"},{"w":"aspiring","pos":"adj.","def":"hoping to become successful in a job","cn":"有抱負的;想成為…的","s":"The workshop is free for ________ writers, so many university students joined it during the summer holiday.","zh":"這個工作坊免費開放給有志成為作家的人,所以許多大學生在暑假參加。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B154","t":"有志成為"},{"w":"impressive","pos":"adj.","def":"causing admiration","cn":"令人印象深刻的","s":"His drawing skills are ________ for a twelve-year-old, so the art teacher entered his work in a national competition.","zh":"以十二歲來說,他的繪畫技巧令人印象深刻,所以美術老師把他的作品送去參加全國比賽。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B155","t":"令人印象深刻"},{"w":"intimate","pos":"adj.","def":"small and private, making people feel close","cn":"親密的;溫馨的","s":"The singer chose an ________ café for her concert, because she wanted to talk with fans between songs.","zh":"這位歌手選了一家溫馨的小咖啡館開演唱會,因為她想在歌曲之間和歌迷聊天。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B156","t":"溫馨的"},{"w":"lyrical","pos":"adj.","def":"expressing feelings in a beautiful, song-like way","cn":"抒情的","s":"The writer's ________ descriptions of the countryside are beautiful, so many readers now want to visit the small village.","zh":"作者對鄉村抒情的描寫很優美,所以現在許多讀者都想去造訪那座小村莊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B157","t":"抒情的"},{"w":"melodramatic","pos":"adj.","def":"showing emotions in a very exaggerated way","cn":"誇張煽情的","s":"The TV drama is very ________, and the characters cry or shout in almost every scene.","zh":"這部電視劇非常誇張煽情,角色幾乎每場戲都在哭或大吼。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B158","t":"誇張煽情"},{"w":"monochrome","pos":"adj.","def":"using only one colour or black and white","cn":"單色的;黑白的","s":"The artist painted the whole room in ________ grey, so the single red chair in the middle stood out.","zh":"藝術家把整個房間漆成單色的灰色,所以中間那把紅椅子格外醒目。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B159","t":"單色的"},{"w":"naturalistic","pos":"adj.","def":"showing things as they appear in nature","cn":"自然主義的;逼真的","s":"The bird paintings are so ________ that scientists use them to identify species in the forest.","zh":"這些鳥類畫作非常逼真,科學家甚至用它們來辨認森林裡的物種。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B160","t":"逼真"},{"w":"neglected","pos":"adj.","def":"not given enough attention or care","cn":"被忽視的","s":"Many women painters were ________ for centuries, but museums are now bringing their works out of storage.","zh":"許多女性畫家數百年來被忽視,但博物館現在正把她們的作品從倉庫中拿出來展示。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B161","t":"被忽視"},{"w":"obsessive","pos":"adj.","def":"thinking about something too much","cn":"執著的;過分投入的","s":"He is ________ about details, so he spent three days painting a single leaf until he was happy.","zh":"他對細節非常執著,所以他花了三天畫一片葉子直到滿意為止。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B162","t":"執著"},{"w":"offbeat","pos":"adj.","def":"unusual and not what most people expect","cn":"另類的;不落俗套的","s":"The band has an ________ style, and they often play songs with kitchen pots instead of drums.","zh":"這個樂團有不落俗套的風格,他們常用廚房的鍋子代替鼓來演奏。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B163","t":"不落俗套的"},{"w":"quirky","pos":"adj.","def":"unusual in an interesting way","cn":"古靈精怪的;奇特的","s":"The café is full of ________ furniture, such as a bathtub sofa, so it is very popular on Instagram.","zh":"這家咖啡廳充滿奇特的家具,例如浴缸沙發,所以在Instagram上非常受歡迎。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B164","t":"奇特的"},{"w":"raw","pos":"adj.","def":"natural and not polished","cn":"原始的;未經修飾的","s":"The singer's voice sounds ________ and honest, so listeners feel that she really means every word.","zh":"這位歌手的聲音聽起來未經修飾而真誠,所以聽眾覺得她是真心唱出每一個字。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B165","t":"未經修飾"},{"w":"rebellious","pos":"adj.","def":"refusing to follow rules","cn":"叛逆的","s":"The ________ young painters left the art academy, and they held their own exhibition in an old warehouse.","zh":"這群叛逆的年輕畫家離開了藝術學院,在一間舊倉庫舉辦了自己的展覽。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B166","t":"叛逆的"},{"w":"reflective","pos":"adj.","def":"thinking quietly and deeply","cn":"沉思的;深思的","s":"The slow music put me in a ________ mood, so I sat by the window and thought about the past year.","zh":"緩慢的音樂讓我進入沉思的心情,所以我坐在窗邊回想過去這一年。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B167","t":"沉思的"},{"w":"self-indulgent","pos":"adj.","def":"doing what pleases yourself without thinking of others","cn":"自我陶醉的;放縱自我的","s":"Some critics called the film ________, because the director made it four hours long and included scenes from his own childhood.","zh":"有些評論家說這部電影自我陶醉,因為導演把它拍成四小時,還加入了他自己童年的場景。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B168","t":"自我陶醉"},{"w":"sombre","pos":"adj.","def":"dark and serious","cn":"陰沉的;肅穆的","s":"The war museum uses ________ colours in every room, so visitors naturally speak more quietly inside.","zh":"戰爭博物館每個展間都使用肅穆的色調,所以參觀者在裡面自然而然地放低音量。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B169","t":"肅穆的"},{"w":"spiritual","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to deep feelings and beliefs rather than the body","cn":"心靈的;精神的","s":"For many people, temple music has a ________ meaning, and it helps them feel calm and connected to their ancestors.","zh":"對許多人來說,廟宇音樂具有心靈上的意義,它幫助他們感到平靜並與祖先相連。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B170","t":"心靈上的"},{"w":"stylised","pos":"adj.","def":"drawn in a simple, artistic way rather than realistically","cn":"風格化的","s":"The cartoon uses ________ characters with huge eyes, but children still find them easy to understand.","zh":"這部卡通使用有著大眼睛的風格化角色,但孩子們仍覺得很容易理解。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B171","t":"風格化"},{"w":"tasteless","pos":"adj.","def":"ugly or offensive, showing bad judgement","cn":"品味差的;低俗的","s":"Many people thought the advertisement was ________, because it made jokes about a recent disaster.","zh":"許多人認為這則廣告低俗,因為它拿最近的災難開玩笑。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B172","t":"低俗"},{"w":"tormented","pos":"adj.","def":"suffering great mental pain","cn":"飽受折磨的","s":"The ________ artist painted dark pictures after losing his son, and his friends worried about his health.","zh":"這位飽受折磨的藝術家在失去兒子後畫起了陰暗的作品,朋友們都擔心他的健康。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B173","t":"飽受折磨的"},{"w":"unfinished","pos":"adj.","def":"not completed","cn":"未完成的","s":"The composer died before the end of the piece, so the ________ symphony stops suddenly in the middle of a melody.","zh":"作曲家在作品完成前過世,所以這首未完成的交響曲在旋律中途戛然而止。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B174","t":"未完成的"},{"w":"unrecognised","pos":"adj.","def":"not given the respect it deserves","cn":"未被賞識的","s":"Her talent remained ________ for many years, but a short video online finally made her famous.","zh":"她的才華多年來未被賞識,但網路上一段短片終於讓她出名。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B175","t":"未被賞識"},{"w":"brilliantly","pos":"adv.","def":"extremely well or brightly","cn":"出色地","s":"The students performed the play ________, and the principal invited them to perform it again for the parents.","zh":"學生們出色地演出這齣戲,校長邀請他們再為家長演一次。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B176","t":"出色地"},{"w":"critically","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that judges carefully","cn":"批判性地","s":"We learned to look ________ at advertisements, because many of them use beautiful images to hide the truth.","zh":"我們學會批判性地看待廣告,因為許多廣告用漂亮的圖像掩蓋真相。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B177","t":"批判性地"},{"w":"delicately","pos":"adv.","def":"in a gentle and careful way","cn":"細緻地;輕柔地","s":"The flowers on the vase are ________ painted, and each petal has several shades of pink.","zh":"花瓶上的花朵畫得很細緻,每片花瓣都有好幾層粉紅色。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B178","t":"細緻"},{"w":"distinctly","pos":"adv.","def":"clearly and noticeably","cn":"明顯地;清楚地","s":"I ________ remember my first visit to the art museum, because a guard shouted at me for touching a statue.","zh":"我清楚地記得第一次去美術館的情形,因為警衛因我摸了雕像而對我大吼。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B179","t":"清楚地"},{"w":"effortlessly","pos":"adv.","def":"without seeming to try hard","cn":"毫不費力地","s":"The dancer moved ________ across the stage, but she later said that the routine took her two years to learn.","zh":"舞者毫不費力地在舞台上移動,但她後來說這套舞花了她兩年才學會。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B180","t":"毫不費力地"},{"w":"exceptionally","pos":"adv.","def":"unusually; to a very great degree","cn":"格外地;非常","s":"The young cellist is ________ talented, so she was invited to study in Vienna when she was only fourteen.","zh":"這位年輕大提琴家格外有才華,所以她十四歲就受邀到維也納深造。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B181","t":"格外"},{"w":"faithfully","pos":"adv.","def":"exactly and accurately","cn":"忠實地","s":"The film ________ follows the novel, so readers who loved the book will not be disappointed.","zh":"這部電影忠實地依循原著小說,所以喜愛這本書的讀者不會失望。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B182","t":"忠實地"},{"w":"freely","pos":"adv.","def":"without being limited or controlled","cn":"自由地","s":"In the art room, the children can paint ________, and the teacher never tells them which colours to use.","zh":"在美術教室裡,孩子們可以自由地畫畫,老師從不告訴他們該用什麼顏色。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B183","t":"自由地"},{"w":"intensely","pos":"adv.","def":"very strongly","cn":"強烈地;極度地","s":"The actress prepared ________ for the role, and she lived alone in a forest for a month before filming began.","zh":"這位女演員為角色極度投入地準備,開拍前她獨自在森林裡住了一個月。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B184","t":"極度"},{"w":"intricately","pos":"adv.","def":"with many small, detailed parts","cn":"錯綜精細地","s":"The wooden screen is ________ carved with birds and flowers, and it took the craftsman three years to finish.","zh":"這座木屏風精細地雕刻著花鳥,工匠花了三年才完成。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B185","t":"精細地"},{"w":"intuitively","pos":"adv.","def":"by feeling rather than careful thinking","cn":"直覺地","s":"The painter chooses colours ________, so she never plans the picture before she starts working.","zh":"這位畫家憑直覺選擇顏色,所以她開始作畫前從不先規劃畫面。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B186","t":"憑直覺"},{"w":"profoundly","pos":"adv.","def":"very deeply","cn":"深刻地","s":"The visit to the war memorial ________ affected the students, and many of them wrote poems about peace afterwards.","zh":"參觀戰爭紀念館深刻地影響了學生,之後許多人寫了關於和平的詩。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B187","t":"深刻地"},{"w":"purely","pos":"adv.","def":"only; completely","cn":"純粹地","s":"She paints ________ for pleasure, so she never sells her work although many people want to buy it.","zh":"她純粹為了樂趣而畫畫,所以雖然很多人想買,她從不出售作品。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B188","t":"純粹"},{"w":"strikingly","pos":"adv.","def":"in a very noticeable way","cn":"驚人地;顯著地","s":"The two paintings look ________ similar, so experts believe the same artist painted both of them.","zh":"這兩幅畫看起來驚人地相似,所以專家相信它們出自同一位畫家之手。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B189","t":"驚人地"},{"w":"subtly","pos":"adv.","def":"in a slight way that is not easy to notice","cn":"微妙地;不著痕跡地","s":"The colours change ________ from blue to green, so you only notice it when you look at the whole painting.","zh":"顏色從藍色微妙地轉為綠色,所以只有看整幅畫時才會注意到。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B190","t":"微妙地"},{"w":"vividly","pos":"adv.","def":"very clearly and brightly","cn":"生動地;鮮明地","s":"The writer describes the night market so ________ that readers can almost smell the stinky tofu.","zh":"作者把夜市描寫得如此生動,讀者幾乎能聞到臭豆腐的味道。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B191","t":"生動"},{"w":"visually","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that relates to seeing","cn":"視覺上","s":"The new museum is ________ beautiful, but some visitors say the signs are too small to read.","zh":"新博物館視覺上很美,但有些參觀者說標示太小看不清楚。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B192","t":"視覺上"},{"w":"aesthetically","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that relates to beauty","cn":"美學上;外觀上","s":"The new bridge is ________ pleasing, and it also allows cyclists to cross the river safely.","zh":"這座新橋在美學上令人賞心悅目,也讓自行車騎士能安全過河。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B193","t":"美學上"},{"w":"imaginatively","pos":"adv.","def":"in a creative way","cn":"富想像力地","s":"The old warehouse was ________ turned into a library, and children can now read inside giant wooden boats.","zh":"這間舊倉庫被富有想像力地改造成圖書館,孩子們現在可以在巨大的木船裡閱讀。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B194","t":"富有想像力地"},{"w":"spontaneously","pos":"adv.","def":"suddenly and without planning","cn":"自發地;即興地","s":"The crowd ________ began to sing along with the busker, and soon the whole station was full of music.","zh":"群眾自發地跟著街頭藝人唱起歌來,很快整個車站都充滿了音樂。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B195","t":"自發地"},{"w":"candidly","pos":"adv.","def":"honestly and openly","cn":"坦率地","s":"The actor spoke ________ about his failures in the interview, so many young fans felt encouraged by his story.","zh":"這位演員在訪談中坦率地談論自己的失敗,所以許多年輕粉絲受到他的故事鼓舞。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B196","t":"坦率地"},{"w":"consciously","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that is planned and deliberate","cn":"有意識地;刻意地","s":"The designer ________ chose recycled materials, because she wanted her shop to cause less pollution.","zh":"這位設計師刻意地選擇回收材料,因為她希望她的店能減少污染。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B197","t":"刻意地"},{"w":"endlessly","pos":"adv.","def":"without stopping","cn":"無止盡地;不斷地","s":"The little boy watched the video ________, so he could soon copy every dance move perfectly.","zh":"這個小男孩不斷地看那支影片,所以他很快就能完美模仿每個舞步。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B198","t":"不斷地"},{"w":"notoriously","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that is famous for something bad","cn":"出了名地","s":"Art school is ________ expensive in many countries, so many talented students cannot afford to attend it.","zh":"在許多國家,藝術學校出了名地昂貴,所以許多有才華的學生負擔不起。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B199","t":"出了名地"},{"w":"masterfully","pos":"adv.","def":"with great skill","cn":"高明地;熟練地","s":"The director ________ builds tension in the film, and the audience holds its breath during the final scene.","zh":"導演在電影中高明地營造緊張感,觀眾在最後一幕都屏住了呼吸。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B200","t":"高明地"},{"w":"art for art's sake","pos":"n.phr.","def":"art made only for beauty, not for any other purpose","cn":"為藝術而藝術","s":"He does not paint to make money or teach lessons, because he believes in ______ ______ ______ ______.","zh":"他畫畫不是為了賺錢或說教,因為他信奉為藝術而藝術。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P1","t":"為藝術而藝術"},{"w":"a picture is worth a thousand words","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an image can explain more than a long description","cn":"一圖勝千言","s":"Our teacher showed us one photo of the flood instead of reading the report, because ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______.","zh":"老師給我們看一張水災的照片而不是念報告,因為一圖勝千言。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P2","t":"一圖勝千言"},{"w":"beauty is in the eye of the beholder","pos":"n.phr.","def":"different people have different ideas of what is beautiful","cn":"情人眼裡出西施;美因人而異","s":"My brother thinks the strange sculpture is ugly, but I love it, so I guess ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______.","zh":"我哥覺得那座怪雕塑很醜,但我很喜歡,所以我想美是因人而異的。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P3","t":"美是因人而異的"},{"w":"the bigger picture","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the whole situation, not just small details","cn":"大局;全貌","s":"Do not worry too much about one small mistake in your drawing, and try to look at ______ ______ ______.","zh":"不要太擔心畫中的一個小錯誤,試著看看整體大局。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P4","t":"整體大局"},{"w":"paint a picture of","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to describe something in a particular way","cn":"描繪出…的樣貌","s":"The documentary ______ ______ ______ ______ life in a poor fishing village, and many viewers decided to donate money.","zh":"這部紀錄片描繪出一個貧窮漁村的生活樣貌,許多觀眾因此決定捐款。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P5","t":"描繪出 樣貌"},{"w":"draw inspiration from","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to get ideas for your work from something","cn":"從…汲取靈感","s":"Many fashion designers ______ ______ ______ old movies, so you can see styles from the 1950s in their new collections.","zh":"許多時裝設計師從老電影汲取靈感,所以你能在他們的新系列中看到1950年代的風格。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P6","t":"從 汲取靈感"},{"w":"a work of art","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a painting, sculpture or other piece of art; something very beautiful","cn":"藝術品","s":"The birthday cake was ______ ______ ______ ______, and nobody wanted to cut it because it looked like a small castle.","zh":"那個生日蛋糕簡直是一件藝術品,沒有人捨得切,因為它看起來像一座小城堡。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P7","t":"藝術品"},{"w":"a labour of love","pos":"n.phr.","def":"hard work done because you love it, not for money","cn":"出於熱愛而做的辛苦工作","s":"Restoring the old temple paintings was ______ ______ ______ ______ for the artist, because she received almost no money for her years of work.","zh":"修復這些古廟畫作對這位藝術家來說是一項出於熱愛的辛苦工作,因為她多年的付出幾乎沒有報酬。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P8","t":"出於熱愛的辛苦工作"},{"w":"get the creative juices flowing","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to help yourself start having ideas","cn":"激發創意","s":"I always listen to music before I write, because it helps me ______ ______ ______ ______ ______.","zh":"我寫作前總是聽音樂,因為它幫助我激發創意。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P9","t":"激發創意"},{"w":"push the boundaries","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to try to do more than what is usual or accepted","cn":"突破界限","s":"The young dancers want to ______ ______ ______ of traditional dance, so they mix Taiwanese folk steps with hip-hop.","zh":"這群年輕舞者想要突破傳統舞蹈的界限,所以他們把台灣民俗舞步和嘻哈混搭。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P10","t":"突破 界限"},{"w":"express oneself","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to show your feelings and ideas","cn":"表達自己","s":"Shy students often find it easier to ______ ______ through drawing, because they do not need to speak in front of others.","zh":"害羞的學生常覺得透過畫畫表達自己比較容易,因為他們不需要在別人面前說話。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P11","t":"表達自己"},{"w":"steal the show","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to attract the most attention in a performance","cn":"搶盡風頭","s":"The little girl only had one line in the play, but she ______ ______ ______ when she started to dance.","zh":"那個小女孩在劇中只有一句台詞,但她開始跳舞時就搶盡了風頭。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P12","t":"搶盡了風頭"},{"w":"take centre stage","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to become the most important or noticed thing","cn":"成為焦點","s":"Local artists will ______ ______ ______ at this year's festival, while international stars will perform only on the last night.","zh":"在今年的藝術節中,在地藝術家將成為焦點,而國際明星只會在最後一晚演出。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P13","t":"成為焦點"},{"w":"a hard act to follow","pos":"n.phr.","def":"someone so good that the next person will seem worse","cn":"難以超越的榜樣","s":"The last art teacher was very popular, so she will be ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ for the new teacher.","zh":"上一位美術老師非常受歡迎,所以對新老師來說,她會是難以超越的榜樣。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P14","t":"難以超越的榜樣"},{"w":"bring something to life","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to make something seem real and exciting","cn":"使…栩栩如生","s":"The talented actors ______ the old story ______ ______, and even students who hated history enjoyed the play.","zh":"才華洋溢的演員們讓那個老故事栩栩如生,就連討厭歷史的學生都很喜歡這齣戲。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P15","t":"讓 栩栩如生"},{"w":"not one's cup of tea","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"not something a person likes","cn":"不是某人的菜","s":"Opera is ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, but I still went with my grandmother because she really wanted company.","zh":"歌劇不是我的菜,但我還是陪奶奶去了,因為她真的很想要人作伴。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P16","t":"不是我的菜"},{"w":"strike a chord","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to make people feel sympathy or connection","cn":"引起共鳴","s":"The song about leaving home ______ ______ ______ with many young workers, because they also live far from their families.","zh":"那首關於離鄉的歌引起許多年輕上班族的共鳴,因為他們也住得離家人很遠。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P17","t":"引起 共鳴"},{"w":"behind the scenes","pos":"phr.","def":"secretly or in a way the public does not see","cn":"在幕後","s":"Many people work ______ ______ ______ at a concert, and without them the singers could not perform.","zh":"許多人在演唱會幕後工作,沒有他們,歌手就無法演出。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P18","t":"幕後"},{"w":"one of a kind","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"completely unique","cn":"獨一無二的","s":"Each handmade lamp is ______ ______ ______ ______, so you will never see the same one in another person's house.","zh":"每盞手工燈都是獨一無二的,所以你絕不會在別人家看到一模一樣的。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P19","t":"獨一無二的"},{"w":"make one's mark","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to become successful and noticed","cn":"嶄露頭角;留下印記","s":"The young director quickly ______ ______ ______ in the film industry, and her first movie won three awards.","zh":"這位年輕導演很快就在電影界嶄露頭角,她的第一部電影就贏得了三個獎項。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P20","t":"嶄露頭角"}]};
